
# game/a1s7.rpy:3
translate latin a1s7_a18358cf:

    # "I follow Neferu to the throne room, the cavernous space just as empty as it was during the first trial."
    "Neferu ad aulam solii sequor; vastus ille locus aeque vacuus est ac in primo certamine erat."

# game/a1s7.rpy:4
translate latin a1s7_f7fae1e5:

    # "Like the first trial though, a few of the palace regulars are sitting on the benches; Virginia on the left side of the room, while Alex sits on the right."
    "Ut tamen in primo certamine, pauci e solitis palatii habitatoribus in scamnis sedent: Virginia a sinistra aulae parte, Alex autem a dextra."

# game/a1s7.rpy:5
translate latin a1s7_48ba45b0:

    # "The cat is sat alone, looking tiny compared to the rest of the room, his tail curled neatly under his paws in his lap."
    "Felis solus sedet, minimus prae reliqua aula aspectu, cauda eleganter sub pedibus anterioribus in gremio convoluta."

# game/a1s7.rpy:6
translate latin a1s7_a4518def:

    # "He smiles when he sees me, and I make as if to go sit next to him...but that's when the jackal grabs my hand."
    "Ridet cum me videt, et ad eum sessum ire paro...sed tum chacalus manum meam capit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:7
translate latin a1s7_87ba1ba7:

    # "I pause, and I see Alex's own inquisitive look before I turn to Neferu."
    "Consisto, et vultum Alex ipsum quaerentem video antequam ad Neferu me verto."

# game/a1s7.rpy:8
translate latin a1s7_df8ec4bc:

    # m "\"What?\""
    m "\"Quid?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:10
translate latin a1s7_14170f44:

    # n "\"Why don't we give Virginia some company?\""
    n "\"Cur Virginiam non comitamur?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:12
translate latin a1s7_4ea76a5a:

    # "The jackal smiles at me gently, one of his ears flicking in the direction of the she-wolf."
    "Chacalus mihi leniter ridet, alteram aurem ad lupam movens."

# game/a1s7.rpy:13
translate latin a1s7_6ddb3a05:

    # m "\"Um, you can. I was gonna go sit with Alex.\""
    m "\"Em, tu potes. Ego cum Alex sessum ibam.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:14
translate latin a1s7_9f6d7520:

    # "Neferu's expression doesn't change, but he doesn't let go either, and his voice takes on a gentle, but ominous tone, making me feel a little uncomfortable."
    "Vultus Neferu non mutatur, sed neque me dimittit, et vox eius lenem sed ominosum sonum accipit, quo paulum incommodus fio."

# game/a1s7.rpy:16
translate latin a1s7_e77a8f01:

    # n "\"Depending on how this trial goes, we may have some business to take care of before it officially ends. It would be best if you are close to me.\""
    n "\"Prout hoc certamen cedet, fortasse aliqua negotia expedienda habebimus antequam rite finitur. Optimum erit si prope me es.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:17
translate latin a1s7_fa92ce60:

    # "It's then that I realize what he's getting at."
    "Tum intellego quo spectet."

# game/a1s7.rpy:18
translate latin a1s7_8e9b4948:

    # "Although I don't know what the process of becoming Neferu's \"pet\" is, I imagine it involves some sort of official business, like signing something."
    "Quamquam nescio quo modo \"animal domesticum\" Neferu fiam, puto id aliquod negotium publicum complecti, velut aliquid subscribere."

# game/a1s7.rpy:20
translate latin a1s7_1f4f35df:

    # "So, I give Alex a little frown and shrug, gesturing at the jackal."
    "Ita ad Alex paulum frontem contraho et umeros levo, chacalum demonstrans."

# game/a1s7.rpy:21
translate latin a1s7_b31d1e66:

    # "The cat continues to look confused as I turn away and follow Neferu to the benches on the other side of the room."
    "Felis confusus videri pergit, dum me averto et Neferu ad scamna ex altera aulae parte sequor."

# game/a1s7.rpy:24
translate latin a1s7_4dd52342:

    # v "\"Neferu.\""
    v "\"Neferu.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:25
translate latin a1s7_1fb4a136:

    # "Virginia sits daintily on the bench, one leg elegantly crossed over the other as she holds up a paw, which the jackal kisses."
    "Virginia delicate in scamno sedet, altero crure eleganter super alterum posito, et pedem anteriorem tollit, quem chacalus osculatur."

# game/a1s7.rpy:27
translate latin a1s7_8a872822:

    # n "\"Good day to you, Virginia.\""
    n "\"Bonum diem tibi, Virginia.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:28
translate latin a1s7_ce69bb85:

    # "Even though I try to stay behind Neferu, Virginia peers around the Jackal's muscular side to stare straight at me."
    "Quamquam post Neferu manere conor, Virginia circum latus chacali musculosum prospicit, ut recta me intueatur."

# game/a1s7.rpy:30
translate latin a1s7_9e6317ba:

    # v "\"I see that you've brought a guest.\""
    v "\"Video te hospitem adduxisse.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:31
translate latin a1s7_23ae6dfc:

    # "She holds out her paw again, and it takes me a moment to realize that I should kiss it."
    "Pedem anteriorem rursus porrigit, et paulisper mihi opus est ut intellegam me eum osculari debere."

# game/a1s7.rpy:32
translate latin a1s7_42467725:

    # "I did start that trend after all."
    "Ego tamen hunc morem initio institui."

# game/a1s7.rpy:34
translate latin a1s7_cba4d2d8:

    # n "\"Indeed. Amicus requested I keep him company during the trial.\""
    n "\"Ita sane. Amicus petivit ut eum per certamen comitarer.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:35
translate latin a1s7_035b7197:

    # "As I come up from the paw-kissing, I see Virginia frowning."
    "Cum post osculum pedi datum me erigo, Virginiam frontem contrahentem video."

# game/a1s7.rpy:37
translate latin a1s7_be4e9c87:

    # v "\"My brother shouldn't be burdening you with a silly chore like that. The pet is capable of staying in his room, I imagine.\""
    v "\"Frater meus te tam stulto officio onerare non debet. Animal domesticum in cubiculo suo manere potest, credo.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:39
translate latin a1s7_e4528d6e:

    # n "\"It was a mutual agreement. Besides, he is rather good company once you get to know him.\""
    n "\"Mutuo consensimus. Praeterea satis bonus comes est, ubi eum cognovisti.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:40
translate latin a1s7_0da9822a:

    # v "\"Oh really? It seems our little simian is full of surprises.\""
    v "\"O, vere? Simiolus noster multa miranda habere videtur.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:41
translate latin a1s7_1e16ea7c:

    # "The she-wolf looks pointedly at me, and I don't have much time to wonder what she's talking about before Neferu is sitting down next to her, pulling me to his side to sit next to him."
    "Lupa me significanter intuetur, et vix tempus habeo mirandi de quo loquatur antequam Neferu iuxta eam sedet, me ad latus suum trahens ut iuxta eum sedeam."

# game/a1s7.rpy:43
translate latin a1s7_e72effd4:

    # n "\"That would be an accurate observation.\""
    n "\"Recte id animadverteris.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:44
translate latin a1s7_de87d0a9:

    # "There's a momentary pause before I see Virginia lean forward a bit out of the corner of my eye."
    "Paulisper silent, deinde ex extremo oculo Virginiam paulum se inclinantem video."

# game/a1s7.rpy:45
translate latin a1s7_a19feb72:

    # "When she speaks again, her voice is lowered."
    "Cum rursus loquitur, vox eius submissa est."

# game/a1s7.rpy:47
translate latin a1s7_3a6a848f:

    # v "\"So the rumors are true?\""
    v "\"Rumores igitur veri sunt?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:48
translate latin a1s7_7b37a521:

    # "There's another pause, this time from Neferu."
    "Iterum silentium est, hoc tempore a Neferu."

# game/a1s7.rpy:50
translate latin a1s7_b8c1a05f:

    # n "\"I don't believe I'm in a position to speculate on that. It is not my place to involve myself in wolven politics.\""
    n "\"Non puto me in ea condicione esse ut de eo coniectem. Non est meum rebus publicis Luporum me immiscere.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:52
translate latin a1s7_082eb601:

    # "Virginia laughs softly, one that sounds completely fake."
    "Virginia leniter ridet, risu qui prorsus fictus auditur."

# game/a1s7.rpy:53
translate latin a1s7_278ab1ff:

    # v "\"I'm not a fool, Neferu. I may enjoy your suave tactics, but I'd rather you not use them against me.\""
    v "\"Stulta non sum, Neferu. Blandis tuis artibus fortasse delector, sed malo ne eis contra me utaris.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:55
translate latin a1s7_08e83ab3:

    # n "\"I would not dream of such a thing, Virginia.\""
    n "\"Tale aliquid ne cogitem quidem, Virginia.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:57
translate latin a1s7_9722612c:

    # v "\"Surely.\""
    v "\"Profecto.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:58
translate latin a1s7_5302f407:

    # "Virginia shifts again and now I know for sure that she's looking directly at me."
    "Virginia rursus se movet, et iam certo scio eam recta me intueri."

# game/a1s7.rpy:59
translate latin a1s7_8fe76cbe:

    # v "\"So...I suppose he understands what we're saying, then?\""
    v "\"Itaque...credo eum quae dicimus intellegere, igitur?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:61
translate latin a1s7_6530d09d:

    # n "\"Well, he is sapient, and he does possess a lingua.\""
    n "\"Bene, Sapiens est et Linguam habet.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:63
translate latin a1s7_27f5f8cd:

    # v "\"I mean, he {i}understands{/i} us.\""
    v "\"Hoc volo dicere: nos {i}intellegit{/i}.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:64
translate latin a1s7_dc5cd9c2:

    # "Virginia puts even more emphasis on the word."
    "Virginia verbum etiam vehementius exprimit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:65
translate latin a1s7_9f153607:

    # "I see Neferu looking at the floor, still smiling, though his paws seem to clasp each other a bit tighter than usual."
    "Neferu pavimentum intuentem video, adhuc ridentem, quamquam pedes eius anteriores paulo artius quam solent inter se iungi videntur."

# game/a1s7.rpy:67
translate latin a1s7_860c9f0b:

    # n "\"You'd know better than I, being a wolf. Our children are as intelligent as ourselves, so I'm used to such an idea.\""
    n "\"Tu, cum lupa sis, id melius quam ego scias. Liberi nostri tam intellegentes sunt quam nos ipsi, ita tali cogitationi assuevi.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:69
translate latin a1s7_6c4659d1:

    # v "\"Don't feign ignorance, Neferu. You've been around him far more than I have. It's a simple question, and one that you should answer honestly, otherwise am I to assume that you've brought a little spy to our conversation?\""
    v "\"Ne ignorantiam simules, Neferu. Multo plus quam ego cum eo fuisti. Simplex quaestio est, cui sincere respondere debes; alioquin putandumne mihi est te parvum exploratorem ad colloquium nostrum adduxisse?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:70
translate latin a1s7_5cfc0d68:

    # "Although the words seem harsh and dangerous, Virginia's tone is light, and Neferu just laughs."
    "Quamquam verba dura et periculosa videntur, vox Virginiae levis est, et Neferu tantum ridet."

# game/a1s7.rpy:72
translate latin a1s7_3511a7e2:

    # n "\"You accuse me of deception, yet we both know you've already figured out the answer. Why do {i}you{/i} feign ignorance?\""
    n "\"Me fraudis accusas, et tamen ambo scimus te iam responsum invenisse. Cur {i}tu{/i} ignorantiam simulas?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:73
translate latin a1s7_d96d9831:

    # "The wolf fans herself with an air of nonchalance."
    "Lupa flabello se refrigerat, quasi nihil curet."

# game/a1s7.rpy:75
translate latin a1s7_2ffa3009:

    # v "\"It's the best weapon in discourse...and it is easy to feign stupidity, at least for me. It is expected on my part.\""
    v "\"Optimum telum in disputatione est...et facile est stultitiam simulare, saltem mihi. Id a me exspectatur.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:77
translate latin a1s7_9f97ae9a:

    # n "\"And why would you say something like that?\""
    n "\"Et cur aliquid tale dicas?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:79
translate latin a1s7_253a0ca6:

    # v "\"I have a vagina, Neferu.\""
    v "\"Vaginam habeo, Neferu.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:81
translate latin a1s7_2fed5f54:

    # "It takes me moment to absorb what Virginia just said, but Neferu's already chuckling with what's probably the first genuine laugh of the conversation."
    "Paulisper mihi opus est ut quod Virginia modo dixit percipiam, sed Neferu iam subridet, probabiliter primo vero risu huius colloquii."

# game/a1s7.rpy:82
translate latin a1s7_72e312ee:

    # "I see Alex look over at us again, and this time it looks like his eyes are narrowed a bit."
    "Alex rursus ad nos respicientem video, et hoc tempore oculi eius paulum contracti videntur."

# game/a1s7.rpy:83
translate latin a1s7_ea2b4020:

    # "It takes the jackal a few seconds to get himself under control again as Virginia continues to wave her fan, looking rather pleased with herself."
    "Chacalo paucis secundis opus est ut rursus se contineat, dum Virginia flabellum agitare pergit, satis sibi placens ut videtur."

# game/a1s7.rpy:85
translate latin a1s7_237730de:

    # n "\"Sorry, I'm not used to bluntness here.\""
    n "\"Ignosce, sermoni aperto hic non assuevi.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:87
translate latin a1s7_3fb52083:

    # v "\"It's not impossible for us to be blunt on this moon, Neferu, especially amongst friends.\""
    v "\"Non est nobis in hac luna impossibile aperte loqui, Neferu, praesertim inter amicos.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:88
translate latin a1s7_a81a464c:

    # "I notice the wolf is looking at me again, and once again, I look down."
    "Lupam rursus me intueri animadverto, et iterum oculos demitto."

# game/a1s7.rpy:89
translate latin a1s7_7570b03e:

    # v "\"Anyway, it seems we made quite the mistake in overlooking Simia. I may have to do a little research of my own in the archives. Amicus clearly knew something that we did not.\""
    v "\"Quidquid est, magnum errorem fecisse videmur quia Simiam negleximus. Fortasse mihi quoque pauca in tabulario investiganda erunt. Amicus manifeste aliquid sciebat quod nos nesciebamus.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:90
translate latin a1s7_0a85cc23:

    # "Research?"
    "Investigare?"

# game/a1s7.rpy:91
translate latin a1s7_3cf22b89:

    # "I feel my stomach drop."
    "Venter mihi quasi cadit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:92
translate latin a1s7_e1ec7a6e:

    # "Although Amicus had assured me of things, I don't even know if I really look like a Simian."
    "Quamquam Amicus me de rebus confirmaverat, ne scio quidem an re vera Simio similis sim."

# game/a1s7.rpy:93
translate latin a1s7_1adbfcce:

    # "All it might take is a picture to know that I'm not actually from Simia."
    "Fortasse una imagine opus est ut sciant me re vera ex Simia non esse."

# game/a1s7.rpy:99
translate latin a1s7_e8b1b2ad:

    # "I try to put that thought out of my mind for now as the doors suddenly open and Cato walks in, making his way quickly to the throne."
    "Hanc cogitationem nunc deponere conor, dum ianuae subito aperiuntur et Cato intrat, celeriter ad solium contendens."

# game/a1s7.rpy:100
translate latin a1s7_c64503d7:

    # "Virginia finally takes her eyes off of me, and I can only hope that she's not gonna follow through on her research plans."
    "Virginia tandem oculos a me avertit, et tantum sperare possum eam consilium investigandi non perfecturam esse."

# game/a1s7.rpy:101
translate latin a1s7_a638c2ce:

    # "The throne room is so quiet that I hear the old wolf grunt as he makes his way up the stairs before turning to face us."
    "Aula solii tam quieta est ut senem lupum audiam grunnientem dum gradus ascendit, antequam se vertit ut nos spectet."

# game/a1s7.rpy:102
translate latin a1s7_22d7c169:

    # "After a few seconds, he sits down, his heavy, muscular body slouched a bit in his seat, gazing out at us through his visor."
    "Post pauca secunda sedet, gravi musculoso corpore paulum in sede inclinato, et per ocularium suum nos prospicit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:103
translate latin a1s7_b43cce23:

    # "A few more moments pass in silence, and just as I'm wondering if the trial is going to begin, I hear a soft, mechanical whirring sound as the panel in the ceiling opens up."
    "Pauca alia momenta taciti manemus, et cum iam miror an certamen incipiat, lenem machinalem stridorem audio dum tabula laquearis aperitur."

# game/a1s7.rpy:104
translate latin a1s7_2a2477aa:

    # "A dozen camera drones drift down lazily, fanning out in the air to position themselves in various locations throughout the room."
    "Duodecim camerae volantes lente descendunt, per aerem dissipatae ut variis locis per aulam se collocent."

# game/a1s7.rpy:105
translate latin a1s7_38d37ee2:

    # "One of them floats towards us and hovers just above our heads, the lens seeming to focus on my face."
    "Una ad nos volat et paulum supra capita nostra pendet; lens eius vultui meo accommodari videtur."

# game/a1s7.rpy:106
translate latin a1s7_60a27168:

    # "I drop my head again, the action having become second-nature since I landed on this moon."
    "Caput rursus demitto; hic motus iam mihi naturalis factus est ex quo in hanc lunam descendi."

# game/a1s7.rpy:107
translate latin a1s7_9e518ba1:

    # "Neferu nudges me though."
    "Neferu tamen me leviter impellit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:108
translate latin a1s7_aa1a5f1c:

    # n "\"Come now. Amicus brought you here to be seen.\""
    n "\"Age nunc. Amicus te huc adduxit ut videreris.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:109
translate latin a1s7_0bc9bd0e:

    # "His tone is light as always, but I sense he's not saying that just to tease me."
    "Vox eius levis est ut semper, sed sentio eum hoc non tantum ad me lacessendum dicere."

# game/a1s7.rpy:110
translate latin a1s7_e59a686b:

    # "We're all playing a role here, and my role is to make Amicus look good, to show off to the triumvirates that he went to great lengths to obtain an exotic, fascinating, alien pet."
    "Omnes hic partes agimus, et pars mea est Amicum bene videri facere, triumviris ostendere eum multum operae dedisse ut exoticum, admirabile, alienum animal domesticum obtineret."

# game/a1s7.rpy:111
translate latin a1s7_c5f2a64e:

    # "I might not like it, but that doesn't matter right now, so I lift my head."
    "Mihi fortasse non placet, sed id nunc nihil refert, itaque caput tollo."

# game/a1s7.rpy:112
translate latin a1s7_f3c9f966:

    # "Instead of the dumb, vacant gaze I'd been using this past month, I go with a completely straight face."
    "Pro stulto et vacuo obtutu quo per hunc mensem usus sum, vultum prorsus gravem praebeo."

# game/a1s7.rpy:113
translate latin a1s7_90c89f1a:

    # n "\"Watch the red light on the top of the drone. When it turns green, know that you are being broadcast.\""
    n "\"Lumen rubrum in summo camerae volantis observa. Cum viride fit, scito imaginem tuam publice transmitti.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:114
translate latin a1s7_7a3aa834:

    # com "\"The second trial will begin in ten seconds.\""
    com "\"Secundum certamen post decem secunda incipiet.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:116
translate latin a1s7_c657cd5b:

    # "With that, the lights slowly dim and everything goes completely silent."
    "His dictis, lumina lente minuuntur et omnia prorsus silent."

# game/a1s7.rpy:117
translate latin a1s7_be9d343e:

    # "I just sit there, looking toward the throne, Cato sitting as motionless as an ancient Roman sculpture."
    "Ibi tantum sedeo, ad solium spectans; Cato tam immobilis sedet quam antiqua statua Romana."

# game/a1s7.rpy:119
translate latin a1s7_6b70794a:

    # "Then the doors open, and we all look over, including the cameras."
    "Tum ianuae aperiuntur et omnes eo respicimus, etiam camerae."

# game/a1s7.rpy:123
translate latin a1s7_ae87d4d8:

    # "In walk Amicus and Cassius, side-by-side."
    "Amicus et Cassius intrant, alter iuxta alterum."

# game/a1s7.rpy:124
translate latin a1s7_1d5944f9:

    # "They must have been waiting out there next to each other, just like Alex and I had been before the second trial."
    "Foris alter iuxta alterum exspectavisse debent, sicut Alex et ego ante secundum certamen."

# game/a1s7.rpy:125
translate latin a1s7_2cbbd3ee:

    # "I have to wonder what that must have been like."
    "Mirari debeo quale id fuerit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:126
translate latin a1s7_b7f29472:

    # "Without a word, the two of them walk up the broad, carpeted aisle, in sync with each other."
    "Sine verbo ambo per latam viam tapete stratam ambulant, pari gradu."

# game/a1s7.rpy:127
translate latin a1s7_42e8a2e4:

    # "I stare intently at Amicus as he passes, just in case he looks at me and I can give him an encouraging smile."
    "Amicum praetereuntem attente intueor, si forte me respiciat, ut risu eum confirmare possim."

# game/a1s7.rpy:128
translate latin a1s7_528c10da:

    # "He looks straight ahead though, a more serious expression on his face than I've ever seen."
    "Ille tamen recta ante se spectat, vultu graviore quam umquam vidi."

# game/a1s7.rpy:129
translate latin a1s7_40767009:

    # "Everything stays quiet, the only sound being the muffled shuffling of their padded feet and claws on the carpet."
    "Omnia quieta manent; solus sonus est submissus motus pedum pulvinatorum et unguium eorum in tapete."

# game/a1s7.rpy:130
translate latin a1s7_6569eab5:

    # "Once they reach the foot of the stairs, they come to a stop before they both bow deeply to Cato."
    "Cum ad imos gradus perveniunt, consistunt, deinde ambo alte Catoni inclinant."

# game/a1s7.rpy:131
translate latin a1s7_37671f4f:

    # "This lasts a few seconds before Cato finally shifts again, breaking the illusion that he was made out of stone."
    "Hoc per pauca secunda durat antequam Cato tandem rursus se movet, speciem destruens quasi e lapide factus sit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:132
translate latin a1s7_f3116eb9:

    # ca "\"Very good. You may proceed.\""
    ca "\"Optime. Pergere potestis.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:137
translate latin a1s7_8d6eaddd:

    # "With that, the two brothers straighten back up before walking up the steps, splitting off to stand to either side of the acting emperor."
    "His dictis, ambo fratres rursus se erigunt, gradus ascendunt et se dividunt ut a singulis lateribus eius qui imperatoris munere fungitur stent."

# game/a1s7.rpy:138
translate latin a1s7_2fa988d3:

    # "They turn around and face us, both standing at attention, arms straight down at their sides."
    "Se vertunt et nos spectant, ambo intenti stantes, bracchiis rectis ad latera demissis."

# game/a1s7.rpy:139
translate latin a1s7_58f15cf7:

    # "A drone levitates down from the ceiling, coming to a gentle stop midair in front of Cato."
    "Camera volans e laqueari descendit et leniter in medio aere coram Catone consistit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:140
translate latin a1s7_fd6f00a8:

    # "I notice the tiny red light on the top of the drone turn green, and the old wolf fixes his eyes on the camera."
    "Animadverto parvum lumen rubrum in summo camerae volantis viride fieri, et senex lupus oculos in cameram figit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:141
translate latin a1s7_6e9daf30:

    # ca "\"Welcome to the Trial of Rhetoric.\""
    ca "\"Salvete in Certamine Rhetoricae.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:142
translate latin a1s7_03047fa0:

    # ca "\"Rhetoric has long been a staple of Wolven civilization and one of our greatest assets.\""
    ca "\"Rhetorica iam diu fundamentum cultus Luporum fuit atque una e maximis opibus nostris.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:143
translate latin a1s7_b162b686:

    # ca "\"While known for our strength and tenacity, so too are we known for our use of words in negotiation.\""
    ca "\"Cum vi et perseverantia cogniti simus, etiam verbis quibus in tractationibus utimur cogniti sumus.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:144
translate latin a1s7_d276fd75:

    # "Neferu snorts next to me, loud enough that I wonder if Cato was able to hear it."
    "Neferu iuxta me per nares flat, tam sonore ut mirer an Cato audire potuerit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:145
translate latin a1s7_05fb68ce:

    # "I hope not."
    "Spero non."

# game/a1s7.rpy:146
translate latin a1s7_dd158a68:

    # ca "\"This is why it is not only important that we honor the art and history of debate today, but also prove our ability to use it well.\""
    ca "\"Hac de causa hodie non solum artem et historiam disputandi honorare interest, sed etiam probare nos ea bene uti posse.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:147
translate latin a1s7_3b6baa73:

    # ca "\"Being a competent rhetorician is essential to being a competent emperor.\""
    ca "\"Ut bonus imperator sis, necesse est ut bonus rhetor sis.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:148
translate latin a1s7_66f74ef4:

    # ca "\"Remember the rules; you will have the floor for twenty minutes. Do not reference your challenger. Now, Amicus—\""
    ca "\"Regulas memineritis; per viginti minuta loquendi locum habebitis. Adversarium vestrum ne commemoraveritis. Nunc, Amice...\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:149
translate latin a1s7_c605b9f5:

    # "I see the slightest of twitches in Amicus's frame as he continues to stare ahead."
    "Levissimum motum in corpore Amici video, dum recta ante se intueri pergit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:150
translate latin a1s7_26e87e21:

    # a "\"Yes, emperor?\""
    a "\"Ita, imperator?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:151
translate latin a1s7_7f7b8721:

    # ca "\"Please, honor Adastra and proceed to the floor. Offer your policies through the art of speech.\""
    ca "\"Quaeso, Adastram honora et ad locum loquendi procede. Consilia tua per artem dicendi propone.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:152
translate latin a1s7_a82569c8:

    # "There's a slight pause, then Amicus makes his way down the stairs."
    "Brevis mora est, deinde Amicus gradus descendit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:153
translate latin a1s7_1d2e99aa:

    # "If he's nervous, which I know that he is, he's not showing it at all, his movements calm and reserved."
    "Si sollicitus est, quod scio eum esse, id minime ostendit, motibus tranquillis et temperatis."

# game/a1s7.rpy:154
translate latin a1s7_0f2308b2:

    # "He walks several paces forward, away from the stairs to stand in the middle of the aisle, just slightly ahead of me."
    "Aliquot passus a gradibus procedit, ut in media via stet, paulo ante me."

# game/a1s7.rpy:156
translate latin a1s7_f93288ce:

    # "He's so close, and I wish I could just say something, get up and give him a hug and tell him that he's gonna do great."
    "Tam prope est, et cupio tantum aliquid dicere, surgere eumque amplecti et dicere eum optime acturum esse."

# game/a1s7.rpy:157
translate latin a1s7_a823fbb5:

    # "But I know that time is past, that the moment that everything has been building up to has just arrived."
    "Sed scio tempus illud praeteriisse, momentum ad quod omnia ducebant iam advenisse."

# game/a1s7.rpy:158
translate latin a1s7_d1c3dfee:

    # "It's a strange feeling, watching something that's going to have such a huge impact on your life, but not being able to participate at all."
    "Mirum sensum habes cum aliquid spectas quod vitam tuam tam vehementer mutaturum est, neque tamen omnino participare potes."

# game/a1s7.rpy:159
translate latin a1s7_c062b6ce:

    # "I can only hope that Amicus is ready."
    "Tantum sperare possum Amicum paratum esse."

# game/a1s7.rpy:162
translate latin a1s7_d00972bc:

    # "He begins to speak, and when he does, it's not like his usual voice."
    "Loqui incipit, et cum loquitur, vox eius solitae dissimilis est."

# game/a1s7.rpy:163
translate latin a1s7_c9770ffd:

    # "Instead it's deeper, broader, sonorous, I guess."
    "Sed gravior, plenior, sonora est, credo."

# game/a1s7.rpy:164
translate latin a1s7_f8b65790:

    # "Actually, it's closer to human singing."
    "Re vera cantui humano similior est."

# game/a1s7.rpy:165
translate latin a1s7_4c4071a2:

    # a "\"Twenty millennia ago, we were chosen by the Romanus.\""
    a "\"Ante viginti milia annorum a gente Romanus electi sumus.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:166
translate latin a1s7_bf5057f7:

    # a "\"Out of one thousand species, they chose us, and was that not for a reason?\""
    a "\"E mille generibus nos elegerunt; nonne id ob aliquam causam fecerunt?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:167
translate latin a1s7_a948a6e7:

    # "He's moving his arms and paws a lot too, in broad sweeping motions."
    "Bracchia pedesque anteriores quoque multum movet, motibus latis et fluentibus."

# game/a1s7.rpy:168
translate latin a1s7_c7fdde40:

    # "It's not unlike the dance, though he mostly stays in the same spot."
    "Saltationi non dissimile est, quamquam plerumque eodem loco manet."

# game/a1s7.rpy:169
translate latin a1s7_b9261fb1:

    # a "\"Fifteen millennia ago, we rejected them, we became the first abandoned sibling, and our empire entered a decline of the likes that we had never seen before; closing off relations with siblings, losing children, losing resources—\""
    a "\"Ante quindecim milia annorum eos reiecimus, primus Frater desertus facti sumus, et imperium nostrum ita deminui coepit ut numquam antea vidissemus; commercia cum Fratribus claudentes, Liberos amittentes, opes amittentes...\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:170
translate latin a1s7_040f24a2:

    # "A drone floats around his body, and I can tell that he's playing up the performance to it, dramatically gesturing with overly-exaggerated expressions."
    "Camera volans corpus eius circumvolat, et intellegere possum eum spectaculum ad eam augere, gestus scaenicos facientem cum vultu nimis expresso."

# game/a1s7.rpy:171
translate latin a1s7_7ec54b66:

    # "I realize that it's like I'm watching those dramas I've seen on Adastran television."
    "Intellego me quasi illa dramata spectare quae in televisione Adastrae vidi."

# game/a1s7.rpy:172
translate latin a1s7_ae3d7313:

    # a "\"—We fell long and hard, as if our very moon was sucked into the pit. Five thousand years of misery and desolation, five thousand years until Drusus saved us all.\""
    a "\"...Diu et graviter cecidimus, quasi ipsa luna nostra in foveam absorpta esset. Quinque milia annorum miseriae et solitudinis, quinque milia annorum donec Drusus nos omnes servavit.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:173
translate latin a1s7_32152e5c:

    # "Amicus goes on to describe the history that I had a vague knowledge of, how Drusus re-established contact with the parents, re-united the wolven empire and renamed the world Adastra, a name that represented everything the empire stood for."
    "Amicus historiam describere pergit, quam leviter noveram: quomodo Drusus contactum cum Parentibus restituerit, imperium Luporum rursus coniunxerit et huic mundo nomen Adastra dederit, nomen quod omnia significabat pro quibus imperium stabat."

# game/a1s7.rpy:174
translate latin a1s7_9991895e:

    # a "\"Since then, we've spread far and wide across the galaxy, found lost children, established roads to resources our moon desperately needed...\""
    a "\"Ex eo tempore longe lateque per Galaxiam nos propagavimus, Liberos amissos invenimus, vias ad opes constituimus quibus luna nostra vehementer egebat...\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:175
translate latin a1s7_9d85eb80:

    # a "\"But what we found to be most valuable? Rekindling diplomatic relations with the other siblings.\""
    a "\"Sed quid maximi pretii invenimus? Commercia publica cum ceteris Fratribus renovare.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:176
translate latin a1s7_c52490fa:

    # a "\"With them, we shared knowledge and wealth, establishing ourselves as true siblings once again...until the war.\""
    a "\"Cum illis scientiam et divitias communicavimus, nos rursus veros Fratres constituentes...usque ad bellum.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:177
translate latin a1s7_7410d562:

    # a "\"While our reasons were sound for initiating the conflict, the sudden and unexpected attack frightened the other siblings, leaving them to abandon us once more.\""
    a "\"Quamquam iustas causas habuimus certamen incipiendi, subita et inexspectata oppugnatio ceteros Fratres terruit, ita ut nos iterum desererent.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:178
translate latin a1s7_1a501be7:

    # a "\"We defended our rights and our dignity from the Khemians—\""
    a "\"Iura et dignitatem nostram a Khemianis defendimus...\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:179
translate latin a1s7_622491a5:

    # n "\"Oh, Ahhotep...\""
    n "\"O, Ahhotep...\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:180
translate latin a1s7_c2a27229:

    # "Neferu mutters that under his breath, thankfully."
    "Neferu id submissa voce murmurat, feliciter."

# game/a1s7.rpy:181
translate latin a1s7_c455f4a0:

    # a "\"But at a great cost. Our empire has suffered for our victory...but there is a way to reverse this.\""
    a "\"Sed magno pretio. Imperium nostrum ob victoriam nostram passum est...sed est via qua id convertere possimus.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:182
translate latin a1s7_fc5af409:

    # "I don't know if the wolf is doing a good job since I have no point of reference, but as far as I can tell, he seems to be doing great."
    "Nescio an lupus bene agat, quia nihil habeo cum quo comparem, sed quantum iudicare possum, optime agere videtur."

# game/a1s7.rpy:183
translate latin a1s7_479a0118:

    # "No stuttering, or stumbling, his acting pretty good, especially if I'm comparing him to the dramatic actors I've seen on the screens."
    "Neque balbutit neque haesitat, satis bene partes agens, praesertim si eum cum scaenicis quos in schermis vidi comparo."

# game/a1s7.rpy:184
translate latin a1s7_381d01de:

    # "His movements are powerful, but elegant, just like his voice, and I find myself beaming with a sense of pride that I've never had for someone else before."
    "Motus eius fortes sunt sed elegantes, sicut vox eius, et late ridere me invenio, superbia pro alio affectus qualem numquam antea habui."

# game/a1s7.rpy:185
translate latin a1s7_5c7689be:

    # "He goes on to describe the policies he'd already told me about: re-establish relations with the siblings, fully uplift the children, reshape their role in the the empire."
    "Consilia describere pergit quae iam mihi dixerat: commercia cum Fratribus restituere, Liberos plene ad altiorem cultum provehere, partes eorum in imperio reformare."

# game/a1s7.rpy:186
translate latin a1s7_4deef710:

    # a "\"And the first step?\""
    a "\"Et primus gradus?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:187
translate latin a1s7_1f33d945:

    # "Amicus suddenly turns to face us, though his gaze is on Neferu."
    "Amicus subito ad nos se vertit, quamquam oculi eius in Neferu sunt."

# game/a1s7.rpy:188
translate latin a1s7_0f410fab:

    # a "\"An alliance, one that has been proposed by the Khemians.\""
    a "\"Societas, quae a Khemianis proposita est.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:189
translate latin a1s7_f8ffbde6:

    # a "\"This may seem like a worrying prospect to you; it has never been done in the history of the {i}Galaxias{/i}, but I can promise that while emperor, I will demand respect and equal treatment from the Khemians.\""
    a "\"Haec res vobis sollicita videri potest; numquam in historia {i}Galaxias{/i} facta est, sed promittere possum me, dum imperator ero, a Khemianis observantiam et aequam tractationem postulaturum esse.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:191
translate latin a1s7_f93537a0:

    # a "\"Their arrogance will be tamed, and wolven dignity will be restored.\""
    a "\"Superbia eorum domabitur et dignitas Luporum restituetur.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:192
translate latin a1s7_396e87a8:

    # "The light on the camera drone in front of us is green, broadcasting our image to the entirety of Adastra."
    "Lumen camerae volantis coram nobis viride est, imaginem nostram toti Adastrae transmittens."

# game/a1s7.rpy:193
translate latin a1s7_02c5aa44:

    # "I'm at least glad that Neferu is able to control his eye-rolling right now."
    "Saltem gaudeo Neferu nunc se ab oculis volvendis continere posse."

# game/a1s7.rpy:195
translate latin a1s7_c84e06a8:

    # a "\"Within the course of my rule, I will place Adastra on the same pedestal as all the other siblings, if not higher. No longer will we be the half-sibling of the {i}Galaxias{/i}.\""
    a "\"Dum regnabo, Adastram in eodem fastigio ac omnes ceteros Fratres collocabo, si non altiore. Non iam Frater dimidius {i}Galaxias{/i} erimus.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:196
translate latin a1s7_61d5b594:

    # a "\"No, we will once again stretch beyond our system, beyond our quadrant, and yes, eventually beyond the galaxy.\""
    a "\"Non, iterum nos ultra systema nostrum extendemus, ultra quadrantem nostrum et, ita, tandem ultra Galaxiam.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:197
translate latin a1s7_98529218:

    # "Amicus points to the ceiling."
    "Amicus laquear monstrat."

# game/a1s7.rpy:200
translate latin a1s7_de8aea12:

    # a "\"As Drusus proclaimed ten millennia ago; 'to the stars'.\""
    a "\"Ut Drusus ante decem milia annorum proclamavit: 'ad astra'.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:201
translate latin a1s7_44be144a:

    # a "\"So I say now; to the stars, and beyond.\""
    a "\"Ita nunc dico: ad astra et ultra.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:202
translate latin a1s7_f518e67d:

    # "Amicus pauses dramatically in that pose, then bows before turning and walking back to the throne."
    "Amicus hoc gestu scaenice paulisper manet, deinde inclinat, se vertit et ad solium redit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:204
translate latin a1s7_d6b27aa7:

    # ca "\"Thank you, Amicus. Cassius?\""
    ca "\"Gratias, Amice. Cassi?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:205
translate latin a1s7_91d2c494:

    # "I let out a breath, watching as Amicus makes his way up the steps, passing Cassius as his brother makes his way to the same spot on the floor."
    "Spiritum emitto, spectans Amicum gradus ascendentem et Cassium praetereuntem, dum frater eius ad eundem locum in pavimento procedit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:206
translate latin a1s7_e99fe507:

    # "So that's it."
    "Ita hoc est."

# game/a1s7.rpy:207
translate latin a1s7_0b283578:

    # "Amicus's part is done."
    "Pars Amici perfecta est."

# game/a1s7.rpy:208
translate latin a1s7_e149cb16:

    # "Now it's Cassius's turn, and I watch as he walks to the same spot, an angry scowl on his face."
    "Nunc Cassii vices sunt, et eum ad eundem locum ambulantem specto, fronte irate contracta."

# game/a1s7.rpy:210
translate latin a1s7_fd7d939d:

    # "It's angrier than usual, almost furious, and I wonder if he's upset about how well Amicus had done."
    "Iracundior quam solet est, paene furiosus, et miror an iratus sit quod Amicus tam bene egerit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:211
translate latin a1s7_5780c466:

    # "But then he starts speaking, and I realize it's part of his show."
    "Sed tum loqui incipit, et intellego id spectaculi eius partem esse."

# game/a1s7.rpy:214
translate latin a1s7_db105b1b:

    # c "\"For three hundred years, our empire has been in shambles!\""
    c "\"Per trecentos annos imperium nostrum perturbatum iacuit!\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:215
translate latin a1s7_d665a5be:

    # "I jump, and I even feel Neferu tense up next to me as the white wolf practically screams."
    "Subsilio et etiam Neferu iuxta me tendi sentio, dum albus lupus paene clamat."

# game/a1s7.rpy:216
translate latin a1s7_3750b114:

    # c "\"Not because of the war, not because we chose a different path. No, this is {i}because{/i} of Drusus and his flawed vision of the {i}Galaxias{/i} as a whole!\""
    c "\"Non propter bellum, non quia aliam viam elegimus. Non, id {i}propter{/i} Drusum est et vitiosam eius totius {i}Galaxias{/i} imaginem!\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:217
translate latin a1s7_7cb3421b:

    # c "\"My brother was right about ONE thing...Adastra is the lowest of the low amongst the siblings, the laughingstock of the entire galaxy!\""
    c "\"Frater meus de UNA re recte dixit...Adastra infima inter infimos Fratres est, ludibrium totius Galaxiae!\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:218
translate latin a1s7_b43176c8:

    # ca "\"No references to Amicus, Cassius!\""
    ca "\"Amicum ne commemoraveris, Cassi!\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:219
translate latin a1s7_f5605e87:

    # "Cato barks from across the throneroom, but the other wolf ignores him, swiping his paw through the air, his movements aggressive and violent."
    "Cato ex altera aulae solii parte latrat, sed alter lupus eum neglegit, pedem anteriorem per aerem agitans, motibus ferocibus et violentis."

# game/a1s7.rpy:221
translate latin a1s7_7f5d4e54:

    # c "\"ENOUGH of being the butt of jokes, of being spat upon, of being considered at the level of mere children!\""
    c "\"SATIS est iocorum materiam esse, conspui, in aequo cum meris Liberis haberi!\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:222
translate latin a1s7_ae3ed836:

    # c "\"It is time for Adastra to once again be respected, revered...and feared, just like before Drusus.\""
    c "\"Tempus est Adastram rursus observari, revereri...et timeri, sicut ante Drusum.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:223
translate latin a1s7_8e3debbd:

    # "Cassius's speech goes on like that, describing Adastra in terms that make it sound like the worst place in the galaxy to be."
    "Oratio Cassii ita pergit, Adastram verbis describens quibus pessimus totius Galaxiae locus habitandi videatur."

# game/a1s7.rpy:224
translate latin a1s7_3699dfce:

    # "I don't know if this is good or not."
    "Nescio an hoc bonum sit necne."

# game/a1s7.rpy:225
translate latin a1s7_17416a16:

    # "He's definitely being way more intense than Amicus was, and if that's the goal, then I'm worried."
    "Multo sane vehementior est quam Amicus erat, et si id propositum est, sollicitus sum."

# game/a1s7.rpy:226
translate latin a1s7_7caab28b:

    # "I glance over at Neferu and Virginia, and the troubled looks on their faces tell me that I should be even more worried."
    "Neferu et Virginiam breviter intueor, et vultus eorum turbati mihi indicant me etiam magis sollicitum esse debere."

# game/a1s7.rpy:227
translate latin a1s7_67d71d4d:

    # "I look up toward the throne, but Amicus is as still and straight-faced as ever."
    "Ad solium suspicio, sed Amicus tam immobilis et gravis est quam semper."

# game/a1s7.rpy:228
translate latin a1s7_c316a9e2:

    # "I feel myself start to sweat, wondering if this is the beginning of the end."
    "Me sudare incipere sentio, mirans an hoc initium finis sit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:230
translate latin a1s7_71d1f56d:

    # c "\"My brother stated that the war was responsible for our sudden decline, a decline not so sudden when it's been happening for thousands of years!\""
    c "\"Frater meus dixit bellum subitae ruinae nostrae causam fuisse, ruinae non tam subitae cum per milia annorum fiat!\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:231
translate latin a1s7_078b6339:

    # c "\"No, that war was the best thing that could have ever happened to this empire. It showed that we were unafraid, unintimidated by the most powerful force in the galaxy!\""
    c "\"Non, illud bellum optima res fuit quae huic imperio umquam accidere potuit. Ostendit nos intrepidos fuisse nec a potentissima vi Galaxiae territos!\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:232
translate latin a1s7_623d57a6:

    # c "\"We were mocked and laughed at openly before the war! Now, those laughs are quieter, behind dainty paws as our siblings realize just how dangerous we can be. They take us seriously now...\""
    c "\"Ante bellum palam irridebamur et deridebamur! Iam illi risus submissiores sunt, post delicatos pedes anteriores, cum Fratres nostri intellegant quam periculosi esse possimus. Iam nos pro gravibus habent...\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:233
translate latin a1s7_360cf912:

    # "Cassius turns his angry gaze on us."
    "Cassius iratum obtutum in nos vertit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:234
translate latin a1s7_d4fefa46:

    # c "\"...but not seriously enough. Look who they sent to propose this...this {i}alliance{/i} that my brother spoke of.\""
    c "\"...sed non satis graves. Videte quem miserint ad hanc...hanc {i}societatem{/i} proponendam, de qua frater meus locutus est.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:235
translate latin a1s7_01dacc4a:

    # ca "\"No references to Amicus, Cassius.\""
    ca "\"Amicum ne commemoraveris, Cassi.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:236
translate latin a1s7_38a1c3ce:

    # "But Cato is quieter now, as if he knows he can't stop the young wolf."
    "Sed Cato iam submissius loquitur, quasi sciat se iuvenem lupum sistere non posse."

# game/a1s7.rpy:237
translate latin a1s7_86b57853:

    # "Our camera light turns green, and I once again get the feeling that the broadcast is displaying Neferu."
    "Lumen camerae nostrae viride fit, et rursus sentio imaginem transmissam Neferu ostendere."

# game/a1s7.rpy:238
translate latin a1s7_d1aa507f:

    # c "\"The one and only Flower of Khemia. The pharaoh's faggot son with his oils and perfumes, stinking up the halls of our palace!\""
    c "\"Unus et unicus Flos Khemiae. Cinaedus ille pharaonis filius cum oleis et unguentis suis, porticus palatii nostri foetore implens!\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:239
translate latin a1s7_bb9160a5:

    # "I glance up at Neferu, but his expression has hardly changed, though I see a hint of a smirk on his lips."
    "Neferu breviter suspicio, sed vultus eius vix mutatus est, quamquam vestigium subrisus in labiis eius video."

# game/a1s7.rpy:240
translate latin a1s7_f3e1aad0:

    # "Meanwhile, Virginia is hiding a look of shock, or horror...or both, behind her fan."
    "Interea Virginia vultum attonitum aut horrentem...aut utrumque post flabellum suum celat."

# game/a1s7.rpy:241
translate latin a1s7_a83326d8:

    # c "\"This alliance is highly suspect, and I must wonder what is really going on during these...negotiations. Actually, let me give you an idea.\""
    c "\"Haec societas valde suspecta est, et mirari debeo quid re vera inter has...tractationes fiat. Immo, vobis aliquid ostendam.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:242
translate latin a1s7_fdd258b9:

    # "Cassius makes a sort of signal with his paw, then pauses."
    "Cassius quoddam signum pede anteriore facit, deinde paulisper tacet."

# game/a1s7.rpy:243
translate latin a1s7_ce395ffc:

    # "Everything is silent for a moment, and looking at the cameras...none of them are green."
    "Omnia paulisper silent et, cum cameras intueor...nullius lumen viride est."

# game/a1s7.rpy:244
translate latin a1s7_ccdc8103:

    # "I look around at the others and can tell that they're confused as well."
    "Ceteros circumspicio et intellegere possum eos quoque confusos esse."

# game/a1s7.rpy:245
translate latin a1s7_af2ff912:

    # ca "\"What are you broadcasting, Cassius?\""
    ca "\"Quid transmittis, Cassi?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:246
translate latin a1s7_a64bd784:

    # "Cassius doesn't even turn around to acknowledge Cato."
    "Cassius ne se quidem vertit ut Catoni respondeat."

# game/a1s7.rpy:248
translate latin a1s7_42cbd147:

    # c "\"Just showing a small video clip.\""
    c "\"Tantum brevem pelliculae partem ostendo.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:249
translate latin a1s7_c61abc9e:

    # ca "\"Of what?\""
    ca "\"Cuius rei?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:250
translate latin a1s7_a1e15b1b:

    # "I see Amicus bristling next to Cato, and I feel the hair standing up on my own neck."
    "Amicum iuxta Catonem pilis erectis video, et pilos in mea quoque cervice erigi sentio."

# game/a1s7.rpy:251
translate latin a1s7_cf97ef5a:

    # c "\"Of a traitorous act between my brother and the flower jackal.\""
    c "\"Facti proditorii inter fratrem meum et chacalum florem.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:252
translate latin a1s7_946a040d:

    # a "\"What!?\""
    a "\"Quid!?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:253
translate latin a1s7_9e1a8f3b:

    # "Amicus is so puffed out he looks almost twice his natural size."
    "Pili Amici tam expansus sunt ut paene duplo maior quam natura sua videatur."

# game/a1s7.rpy:254
translate latin a1s7_b6fc042c:

    # a "\"What are you doing!?\""
    a "\"Quid facis!?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:255
translate latin a1s7_e6752a1b:

    # ca "\"Yes Cassius, what {i}are{/i} you doing?\""
    ca "\"Ita, Cassi, quid {i}facis{/i}?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:256
translate latin a1s7_c81e8aa9:

    # a "\"Cato, he bugged my room!\""
    a "\"Cato, apparatum occultum ad me observandum in cubiculo meo posuit!\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:257
translate latin a1s7_9dfd8ae5:

    # "Amicus starts to move, but Cato reaches out from his throne to hold him back."
    "Amicus movere incipit, sed Cato e solio manum porrigit ut eum retineat."

# game/a1s7.rpy:259
translate latin a1s7_154d2fef:

    # c "\"Stay there, brother, it's almost over. And don't worry; it's censored.\""
    c "\"Ibi mane, frater, paene finita est. Et ne time; censura restricta est.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:260
translate latin a1s7_ac4f5a9b:

    # "Cassius sneers back at Amicus before the red light on his drone suddenly turns green again."
    "Cassius ad Amicum contumeliose subridet antequam lumen rubrum camerae suae volantis subito rursus viride fit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:262
translate latin a1s7_ae98dc87:

    # "Cassius stares at the lens for a moment, letting the silence drag out for dramatic effect."
    "Cassius lentem paulisper fixis oculis intuetur, silentium protrahens ut vim scaenicam augeat."

# game/a1s7.rpy:263
translate latin a1s7_add9fd80:

    # c "\"Shocking, is it not? I already described the Flower of Khemia...do we also want the Flower of Adastra to be our emperor?\""
    c "\"Horrendum, nonne? Iam Florem Khemiae descripsi...num etiam Florem Adastrae imperatorem nostrum esse volumus?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:264
translate latin a1s7_38d11dbd:

    # ca "\"Time, Cassius.\""
    ca "\"Tempus, Cassi.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:265
translate latin a1s7_b4c8fc74:

    # "Cato's voice is soft, sounding almost astonished."
    "Vox Catonis lenis est, paene attonita ut auditur."

# game/a1s7.rpy:266
translate latin a1s7_bec78dc0:

    # "Amicus is clearly having a much harder time keeping his emotions in check now."
    "Amicus nunc manifeste multo difficilius affectus suos continet."

# game/a1s7.rpy:267
translate latin a1s7_481a6df0:

    # "Even from this distance, I can see him working his jaw."
    "Etiam ex hoc intervallo eum maxillam moventem videre possum."

# game/a1s7.rpy:268
translate latin a1s7_a55997e5:

    # "But Cassius doesn't seem to be finished."
    "Sed Cassius finem fecisse non videtur."

# game/a1s7.rpy:269
translate latin a1s7_ca30f34a:

    # c "\"And let me leave you with this—\""
    c "\"Et hoc vobis tandem relinquam...\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:270
translate latin a1s7_8b519d9d:

    # ca "\"TIME, Cassius. Yield the floor!\""
    ca "\"TEMPUS, Cassi. Locum loquendi cede!\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:272
translate latin a1s7_ac20b244:

    # c "\"No, I will not yield! Adastra is the one out of time! This empire is stretched thin, and that tail-raiser proposes that we stretch even further! When do we break!?\""
    c "\"Non, non cedam! Adastra ipsa est cui tempus deficit! Hoc imperium iam ultra vires extenditur, et ille caudam attollens proponit ut etiam longius nos extendamus! Quando frangimur!?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:273
translate latin a1s7_21a57bc1:

    # "Cassius whirls around and points a finger at Amicus."
    "Cassius subito se convertit et digitum in Amicum intendit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:274
translate latin a1s7_29c8351d:

    # c "\"He looks toward the children and the siblings while completely ignoring US!\""
    c "\"Ad Liberos et Fratres spectat, dum NOS prorsus neglegit!\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:276
translate latin a1s7_753e2c9d:

    # "Cassius's bristled fur slowly starts to lay down again, the wolf making a show of trying to get himself under control again."
    "Pili Cassii erecti lente rursus iacent, lupo ostentante se rursus continere conari."

# game/a1s7.rpy:278
translate latin a1s7_0c4686e1:

    # c "\"So...let me leave you with this; while campaigning in the outskirts of Adastra city, areas my brother completely neglected, I came across a young child with the same disease that afflicts me.\""
    c "\"Ita...hoc vobis tandem relinquam: dum suffragia in extremis urbis Adastrae partibus petebam, locis quos frater meus prorsus neglexit, parvae puellae occurri quae eodem morbo ac ego afficitur.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:279
translate latin a1s7_3e0089c7:

    # "Cassius's voice becomes much more quiet, gentle, lowering his muzzle a bit to stare at the floor."
    "Vox Cassii multo submissior et lenior fit, dum rostrum paulum demittit ut pavimentum fixis oculis intueatur."

# game/a1s7.rpy:281
translate latin a1s7_dad48b5b:

    # c "\"Unlike me, she had no medication to speak of because her poor, farming family could not afford it. She was bound to a wheelchair, her bones so frail that something as simple as a bath causes them to dislocate and break.\""
    c "\"Aliter ac ego, medicamenta vix ulla habebat, quia familia eius pauper et agricola ea solvere non poterat. Sellae rotali obligata erat, ossibus tam fragilibus ut etiam res tam simplex quam balneum ea loco moveat et frangat.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:282
translate latin a1s7_d760ac15:

    # "Cassius's voice catches and, to my surprise, I see a tear slide down his cheek."
    "Vox Cassii haeret et, me mirante, lacrimam per genam eius delabentem video."

# game/a1s7.rpy:284
translate latin a1s7_2e315ae0:

    # c "\"How dare this empire let our people fall into such a state that we cannot even care for our own people. I'm hearing that even now, we can't afford to vaccinate those beyond our glittering city.\""
    c "\"Quomodo hoc imperium ausum est populum nostrum in talem condicionem cadere sinere, ut ne nostros quidem curare possimus? Audio nos etiam nunc pretium vaccinationis pro iis qui extra urbem nostram nitentem sunt solvere non posse.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:285
translate latin a1s7_938e1e70:

    # "Cassius looks back up at the camera."
    "Cassius rursus ad cameram suspicit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:287
translate latin a1s7_9027f0bd:

    # c "\"It may seem as if we cannot hear you past the walls of this palace, but I hear you. I promise to always hear you. I will not cater to the needs and wants of the siblings or children, to the Adastra City elites or officials.\""
    c "\"Fortasse videtur nos ultra muros huius palatii vos audire non posse, sed ego vos audio. Promitto me vos semper auditurum esse. Necessitatibus et cupiditatibus Fratrum aut Liberorum, potentium urbis Adastrae aut magistratuum non serviam.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:288
translate latin a1s7_8dca1ca1:

    # "Cassius sweeps a paw dramatically to his chest."
    "Cassius pedem anteriorem scaenice ad pectus suum ducit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:290
translate latin a1s7_9e0162a7:

    # c "\"Not 'to the stars', but to YOU, the people of the empire...Thank you.\""
    c "\"Non 'ad astra', sed ad VOS, populum imperii...Gratias.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:291
translate latin a1s7_4940241e:

    # "Cassius bows low to the camera before turning to walk back to the throne."
    "Cassius alte camerae inclinat, deinde se vertit ut ad solium redeat."

# game/a1s7.rpy:293
translate latin a1s7_ed37f6b0:

    # "There's a long moment of silence as we all just stare at the white wolf, then Com's voice crackles over our heads."
    "Diu omnes taciti albo lupo tantum inhaeremus oculis, deinde vox Com supra capita nostra crepitat."

# game/a1s7.rpy:294
translate latin a1s7_1602e77e:

    # com "\"Triumvirates, make your decisions.\""
    com "\"Triumviratus, decernite.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:295
translate latin a1s7_99d26f07:

    # "Suddenly, I feel something grasp me around the wrist and look down to see Neferu's furry, black paw holding on to me."
    "Subito aliquid carpum meum capere sentio et deorsum aspicio, ut nigrum pilosum pedem Neferu me tenentem videam."

# game/a1s7.rpy:297
translate latin a1s7_a7175b19:

    # n "\"[mc], very quietly, we are going to get up and head to my room. We'll move around the back so that the camera's do not see.\""
    n "\"[mc], quam quietissime surgemus et ad cubiculum meum ibimus. Per posteriorem partem ibimus, ne camerae nos videant.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:298
translate latin a1s7_fdcfd18e:

    # m "\"Why?\""
    m "\"Cur?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:300
translate latin a1s7_4b5767c1:

    # n "\"Because what Amicus had feared is about to—\""
    n "\"Quia quod Amicus timuerat iam...\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:301
translate latin a1s7_c06914b3:

    # com "\"The triumvirates have made their decisions.\""
    com "\"Triumviratus sententias suas tulerunt.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:302
translate latin a1s7_6e96d783:

    # "I see Neferu's eyes widen in surprise."
    "Video oculos Neferu prae admiratione dilatari."

# game/a1s7.rpy:304
translate latin a1s7_e3366588:

    # n "\"Already?\""
    n "\"Iam?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:305
translate latin a1s7_d328aed7:

    # "He seems to say it to himself, but he stands and I have to stand with him as he starts to walk up the aisle, toward the back of the room, pulling me along with him."
    "Id sibi ipsi dicere videtur, sed surgit et mihi quoque surgendum est, dum per viam ad posteriorem aulae partem ire incipit, me secum trahens."

# game/a1s7.rpy:307
translate latin a1s7_9c5aeb93:

    # "I look back at Amicus and see the wolf looking right back at me, finally."
    "Ad Amicum respicio et lupum tandem recta me vicissim intuentem video."

# game/a1s7.rpy:308
translate latin a1s7_d4971fdd:

    # "His eyes are full of worry and regret, and I can tell that everyone knows that Cassius has won."
    "Oculi eius sollicitudine et paenitentia pleni sunt, et intellegere possum omnes scire Cassium vicisse."

# game/a1s7.rpy:309
translate latin a1s7_36520bcc:

    # "My stomach drops and I realize that what I've been terrified of happening all month is actually happening."
    "Venter mihi quasi cadit, et intellego id quod totum mensem timui re vera fieri."

# game/a1s7.rpy:310
translate latin a1s7_e57925b4:

    # "We've lost."
    "Victi sumus."

# game/a1s7.rpy:311
translate latin a1s7_7f11ca68:

    # "I can only stare at Neferu's muscular arm as it pulls me toward the doors, toward an unknown and unwanted future..."
    "Tantum musculosum bracchium Neferu fixis oculis intueri possum, dum me ad ianuas trahit, ad futura ignota quae nolo..."

# game/a1s7.rpy:312
translate latin a1s7_8a4258b6:

    # com "\"Lupas—\""
    com "\"Lupas...\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:313
translate latin a1s7_52d7ccfe:

    # "After all this time, after everything we'd done...we've lost."
    "Post omne hoc tempus, post omnia quae fecimus...victi sumus."

# game/a1s7.rpy:314
translate latin a1s7_01e36a57:

    # com "\"Amicus.\""
    com "\"Amice.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:315
translate latin a1s7_9064acb9:

    # "Neferu pauses."
    "Neferu consistit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:316
translate latin a1s7_2eaab925:

    # "I look up at the ceiling, toward where I always imagine Com to be if he were real, then I look back at the throne."
    "Laquear suspicio, ad locum ubi semper Com esse fingo si vere exsisteret, deinde ad solium respicio."

# game/a1s7.rpy:317
translate latin a1s7_f453de96:

    # com "\"Ad Rotae: Amicus.\""
    com "\"Ad Rotae: Amicus.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:318
translate latin a1s7_bef91a62:

    # "Amicus looks just as shocked as I am."
    "Amicus aeque attonitus ac ego videtur."

# game/a1s7.rpy:319
translate latin a1s7_861bc1c7:

    # "Cassius, meanwhile, has his jaw set grimly."
    "Cassius interea maxillam torve stringit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:320
translate latin a1s7_5fff10fa:

    # "As always, I can't read Cato."
    "Ut semper, quid Cato sentiat intellegere non possum."

# game/a1s7.rpy:321
translate latin a1s7_547fa854:

    # com "\"Lux: Amicus.\""
    com "\"Lux: Amicus.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:322
translate latin a1s7_5b27feac:

    # com "\"Gebii: Amicus.\""
    com "\"Gebii: Amicus.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:323
translate latin a1s7_1968f3cb:

    # "What the hell is going on?"
    "Quid malum fit?"

# game/a1s7.rpy:324
translate latin a1s7_97168d4f:

    # "It had just seemed like everyone thought Cassius was going to win, and if it was all based on performance...then he should be winning."
    "Modo videbatur omnes putare Cassium victurum esse, et si omnia ex modo agendi penderent...tum ille vincere deberet."

# game/a1s7.rpy:325
translate latin a1s7_9900a84d:

    # com "\"Tricelli: Amicus.\""
    com "\"Tricelli: Amicus.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:326
translate latin a1s7_11665bce:

    # "There's a pause, one that has me realizing that we just...won?"
    "Silentium est, quo intellego nos modo...vicisse?"

# game/a1s7.rpy:327
translate latin a1s7_05bb5b48:

    # "Did we really just win?"
    "Num vere modo vicimus?"

# game/a1s7.rpy:328
translate latin a1s7_ce90c583:

    # com "\"Adastra?\""
    com "\"Adastra?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:329
translate latin a1s7_2ec1906c:

    # "Cato is staring straight ahead with his visor, and now I can see his paws gripping into the armrests of his throne."
    "Cato per ocularium suum recta ante se intuetur, et iam videre possum pedes eius anteriores brachiola solii stringentes."

# game/a1s7.rpy:330
translate latin a1s7_6f811d23:

    # "The silence goes on so long that Com asks again."
    "Tam diu silentium durat ut Com rursus roget."

# game/a1s7.rpy:331
translate latin a1s7_ce90c583_1:

    # com "\"Adastra?\""
    com "\"Adastra?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:332
translate latin a1s7_f444e0c9:

    # "Cato lets the silence continue for several more seconds before finally opening his muzzle."
    "Cato silentium per alia aliquot secunda durare sinit, deinde tandem rostrum aperit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:333
translate latin a1s7_967469f5:

    # ca "\"Cassius.\""
    ca "\"Cassius.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:334
translate latin a1s7_5c03f165:

    # "I don't know what to think, but Com immediately responds."
    "Nescio quid cogitem, sed Com statim respondet."

# game/a1s7.rpy:335
translate latin a1s7_2fe5a6eb:

    # com "\"The trial has been decided. Amicus is the victor.\""
    com "\"Certamen decretum est. Amicus victor est.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:336
translate latin a1s7_3fcbded1:

    # "The silence that follows this time is deafening."
    "Silentium quod hoc tempore sequitur aures paene obtundit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:337
translate latin a1s7_32fa1c03:

    # "No one cheers, no one moves."
    "Nemo acclamat, nemo movetur."

# game/a1s7.rpy:338
translate latin a1s7_9b2c1151:

    # "Even Virginia's fan is frozen, as if we're all stuck in a picture."
    "Etiam flabellum Virginiae immobile est, quasi omnes in imagine haereamus."

# game/a1s7.rpy:339
translate latin a1s7_bb352a47:

    # "All the while, the cameras continue to hover over our heads, each one of them flashing green for a moment."
    "Interea camerae supra capita nostra pendere pergunt, unaquaque paulisper viridi lumine micante."

# game/a1s7.rpy:340
translate latin a1s7_7894238c:

    # "Finally, Com is again the one to break the silence."
    "Tandem Com rursus silentium frangit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:341
translate latin a1s7_5dbf25df:

    # com "\"This concludes the second trial. Thank you.\""
    com "\"Hoc secundum certamen concludit. Gratias.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:342
translate latin a1s7_11e5bde5:

    # "With that, the camera lights turn off completely and the drones hover up toward the compartment in the ceiling."
    "His dictis, lumina camerarum prorsus exstinguuntur et machinae volantes ad receptaculum in laqueari ascendunt."

# game/a1s7.rpy:344
translate latin a1s7_8bb6ce5d:

    # "The lights come back on."
    "Lumina rursus accenduntur."

# game/a1s7.rpy:345
translate latin a1s7_6b241cdc:

    # "As they do, Neferu is once again pulling me toward the doors."
    "Dum accenduntur, Neferu me iterum ad ianuas trahit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:346
translate latin a1s7_08181614:

    # "I want to hold back and watch, but the jackal is insistent, and the next thing I know, the doors are quietly sliding open, and we're walking into the equally silent, though much less tense, atmosphere of the marble halls."
    "Resistere et spectare volo, sed chacalus instat, et mox ianuae quiete delabuntur et nos in marmoreas porticus intramus, ubi aeque silent omnia, sed multo minus anxia sunt."

# game/a1s7.rpy:350
translate latin a1s7_508988b8:

    # m "\"Where are we going? We just won.\""
    m "\"Quo imus? Modo vicimus.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:351
translate latin a1s7_cb4d87b6:

    # "As I say that, I feel the excitement finally replace the shock."
    "Dum id dico, ardorem tandem stupori succedere sentio."

# game/a1s7.rpy:352
translate latin a1s7_c016b0b7:

    # "We won!"
    "Vicimus!"

# game/a1s7.rpy:353
translate latin a1s7_60b53d5a:

    # m "\"Neferu, we wo—\""
    m "\"Neferu, vici...\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:355
translate latin a1s7_d67144de:

    # n "\"Clearly, but that does not mean you are safe, yet.\""
    n "\"Manifeste, sed id non significat te iam tutum esse.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:356
translate latin a1s7_df8ec4bc_1:

    # m "\"What?\""
    m "\"Quid?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:357
translate latin a1s7_e9660974:

    # "Neferu is quiet for a moment, at this point the jackal having let go of my hand, allowing me to just follow behind him."
    "Neferu paulisper tacet; iam chacalus manum meam dimisit, ita ut tantum eum sequi possim."

# game/a1s7.rpy:358
translate latin a1s7_e857f6f3:

    # m "\"What even happened?\""
    m "\"Quid omnino accidit?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:360
translate latin a1s7_83afde2c:

    # n "\"Who do you think should have won, [mc]?\""
    n "\"Quem vincere debuisse putas, [mc]?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:361
translate latin a1s7_e499761a:

    # "I frown."
    "Frontem contraho."

# game/a1s7.rpy:362
translate latin a1s7_1f5fc6cd:

    # m "\"Does that matter? The triumvirates decided. Amicus won.\""
    m "\"Refertne? Triumviratus decreverunt. Amicus vicit.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:363
translate latin a1s7_5720ee15:

    # n "\"True, but not just the triumvirates were watching. We all know who should have won.\""
    n "\"Verum, sed non soli triumviri spectabant. Omnes scimus quis vincere debuerit.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:364
translate latin a1s7_d04a94f1:

    # "I feel myself getting defensive."
    "Me ad defendendum incitari sentio."

# game/a1s7.rpy:365
translate latin a1s7_8eb233fc:

    # m "\"Cassius was being a total asshole, and besides, he cheated. He went over his allowed time AND referenced Amicus and his points.\""
    m "\"Cassius prorsus improbus erat, et praeterea fraudavit. Tempus sibi permissum excessit ET Amicum eiusque argumenta commemoravit.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:366
translate latin a1s7_5dcd30b6:

    # "Neferu laughs mirthlessly."
    "Neferu sine laetitia ridet."

# game/a1s7.rpy:368
translate latin a1s7_1d64322d:

    # n "\"The rules do not matter. I'm sure you've probably realized that by now. Cassius did exactly as he should have...but he lost because of you.\""
    n "\"Regulae nihil valent. Certus sum te id iam probabiliter intellexisse. Cassius prorsus ut debuit egit...sed propter te victus est.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:369
translate latin a1s7_df8ec4bc_2:

    # m "\"What?\""
    m "\"Quid?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:371
translate latin a1s7_f82d284f:

    # n "\"The triumvirates clearly made their decisions long before the trial. We were hoping that they would not go against the will of the people, but Cassius's performance forced them to.\""
    n "\"Triumviratus manifeste multo ante certamen decreverant. Sperabamus eos voluntati populi non repugnaturos esse, sed Cassii actio eos coegit.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:372
translate latin a1s7_073c2301:

    # m "\"You're talking about the rumor about Cassius getting rid of them?\""
    m "\"De rumore loqueris Cassium eos amoturum esse?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:373
translate latin a1s7_4f92778b:

    # n "\"That would be the one. I had thought that such a clearly lopsided win on Cassius's part would have deterred at least most of them. Their hunger for power is insatiable, it seems.\""
    n "\"De eo ipso. Putabam tam manifeste inaequalem Cassii victoriam saltem plerosque deterrituram esse. Cupiditas potestatis eorum inexplebilis est, ut videtur.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:374
translate latin a1s7_2d197b6f:

    # "Again, I feel myself getting defensive, but there's also a sense of worry creeping in."
    "Rursus me ad defendendum incitari sentio, sed etiam sollicitudo irrepit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:375
translate latin a1s7_2f88be96:

    # m "\"Well...I don't know, I think Amicus did great. Besides, it's THEIR role to keep the emperor's power in check anyway, isn't it?\""
    m "\"Bene...nescio, puto Amicum optime egisse. Praeterea imperatoris potestatem continere EORUM munus est tamen, nonne?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:376
translate latin a1s7_b31d0c6c:

    # n "\"Yes, but that's not the point of the trials, and the people know that. Adastra will not be happy about this.\""
    n "\"Ita, sed non hoc est propositum certaminum, et populus id scit. Adastra hac re non gaudebit.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:377
translate latin a1s7_367d9702:

    # m "\"Well...what does that mean, then?\""
    m "\"Bene...quid igitur id significat?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:378
translate latin a1s7_0a507171:

    # "We come to a stop in front of Amicus's room, and finally, the jackal turns to face me."
    "Coram cubiculo Amici consistimus, et tandem chacalus se vertit ut me spectet."

# game/a1s7.rpy:380
translate latin a1s7_cc9ccb63:

    # n "\"That I cannot tell you. I am not an expert on the politics of Adastra, I am simply a student here. Amicus may have won this battle, but I can guarantee that the power struggle is far from over.\""
    n "\"Id tibi dicere non possum. Rei publicae Adastrae peritus non sum; hic tantum discipulus sum. Amicus hanc pugnam fortasse vicit, sed affirmare possum certamen potestatis longe a fine abesse.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:381
translate latin a1s7_2020c021:

    # n "\"Amicus can explain more to you when he arrives. For now, wait for him in his room.\""
    n "\"Amicus plura tibi explicare potest cum venerit. Nunc eum in cubiculo eius exspecta.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:382
translate latin a1s7_78a05ff7:

    # "The jackal starts to turn to leave, but seems to notice the confused, and probably worried look on my face."
    "Chacalus se ad discedendum vertere incipit, sed confusum et probabiliter sollicitum vultum meum animadvertere videtur."

# game/a1s7.rpy:383
translate latin a1s7_1c35c9c3:

    # "He pauses, then sets a paw on my shoulder."
    "Paulisper consistit, deinde pedem anteriorem in umero meo ponit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:385
translate latin a1s7_770ef93f:

    # n "\"Do not fret too much over this. It is par for the course in Wolven politics, that much I do know. Drama is their identity, and we can only be along for the ride.\""
    n "\"Ne nimis de hac re sollicitus sis. Usitatum est in rebus publicis Luporum; tantum quidem scio. Res scaenicae eorum natura sunt, et nos tantum una ferri possumus.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:386
translate latin a1s7_c9c2d55e:

    # "Neferu smiles at me."
    "Neferu mihi ridet."

# game/a1s7.rpy:388
translate latin a1s7_694c0769:

    # n "\"Amicus will keep you safe, and if there's a need you have that he cannot fulfill, I am also here.\""
    n "\"Amicus te tutum servabit, et si aliquid tibi opus est quod ille praestare non potest, ego quoque hic sum.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:389
translate latin a1s7_27fd7dcc:

    # "I know Neferu intends for that to sound salacious, but I also think he means it...in a nice way."
    "Scio Neferu velle id lascive audiri, sed etiam puto eum serio dicere...benigne."

# game/a1s7.rpy:390
translate latin a1s7_194ac54e:

    # "I put my hand on his paw."
    "Manum meam in pede eius anteriore pono."

# game/a1s7.rpy:391
translate latin a1s7_1dfc7b4e:

    # m "\"Thanks.\""
    m "\"Gratias.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:393
translate latin a1s7_2eee462c:

    # "The jackal nods at me before turning away to walk up the hall, probably toward his own room."
    "Chacalus mihi annuit, deinde se vertit et per porticum ambulat, probabiliter ad cubiculum suum."

# game/a1s7.rpy:396
translate latin a1s7_b7392a69:

    # "Once he's out of sight, I press my hand to the panel and walk into Amicus's room, sitting on the sofa to wait."
    "Cum iam eum videre non possum, manum in tabulam premo et cubiculum Amici intro, in lecto sedendi sedens ut exspectem."

# game/a1s7.rpy:399
translate latin a1s7_5344032f:

    # "It's strange...Amicus won, but it doesn't exactly feel that way after what Neferu just told me."
    "Mirum est...Amicus vicit, sed non prorsus ita sentitur post ea quae Neferu modo mihi dixit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:400
translate latin a1s7_28eca392:

    # "Amicus didn't genuinely win...we'd won because of a rumor, basically making the entire trial thing pointless."
    "Amicus non vere vicit...propter rumorem vicimus, qui fere totum certamen inane facit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:401
translate latin a1s7_f95441ce:

    # "Still, I can't exactly feel bad about that."
    "Tamen non prorsus male de eo sentire possum."

# game/a1s7.rpy:402
translate latin a1s7_fe7b0d86:

    # "Cassius bugged this very room to show footage of Amicus fucking Neferu."
    "Cassius in hoc ipso cubiculo apparatum occultum posuit, ut imagines Amici Neferu futuentis ostenderet."

# game/a1s7.rpy:403
translate latin a1s7_00d0b6d6:

    # "I close my eyes, rubbing them with a hand as I realize how much that might have damaged Amicus's reputation."
    "Oculos claudo et manu frico, intellegens quantum id famae Amici nocere potuerit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:404
translate latin a1s7_c125cd68:

    # "Not only do the people realize this trial was decided from the beginning by corrupt triumvirates, but also that their soon-to-be emperor had sex with a male...a Khemian male at that."
    "Populus non solum intellegit hoc certamen ab initio a corruptis triumviris decretum esse, sed etiam eum qui mox imperator fiet cum mare concubuisse...cum mare Khemiano quidem."

# game/a1s7.rpy:405
translate latin a1s7_dbfb698d:

    # "But again, Cassius losing because of his intention to get rid of one of the few checks on his power seems like karma to me."
    "Sed rursus Cassium victum esse, quod unum e paucis suae potestatis vinculis tollere intendit, mihi quasi merita sors videtur."

# game/a1s7.rpy:406
translate latin a1s7_b219e26e:

    # "Weren't they keeping the emperor's power in check by making the decision that they did?"
    "Nonne imperatoris potestatem continebant cum ita decernerent?"

# game/a1s7.rpy:407
translate latin a1s7_7f7b2789:

    # "Technically, Amicus will become emperor now, though I guess it won't be official until Cassius actually concedes the third trial."
    "Re ipsa Amicus iam imperator fiet, quamquam credo id rite ratum non fore donec Cassius tertium certamen vere cedat."

# game/a1s7.rpy:408
translate latin a1s7_bf1dac19:

    # "I turn these thoughts over and over in my head for the next 20 minutes, a bit annoyed by the fact that even though I got exactly what I wanted, several issues had come with it."
    "Per proxima 20 minuta has cogitationes iterum iterumque mente verso, paulum vexatus quod, quamquam id ipsum quod volui obtinui, aliquot difficultates secum tulit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:410
translate latin a1s7_e599bd82:

    # "Suddenly, the door slides open, and I forget my worry for just a moment as I see Amicus standing there."
    "Subito ianua delabitur et aperitur, et sollicitudinem paulisper obliviscor cum Amicum ibi stantem video."

# game/a1s7.rpy:411
translate latin a1s7_0794d658:

    # "He only gets a few steps into the room before I'm already there, wrapping my arms around his body as I hug him."
    "Ille paucos tantum passus in cubiculum facit antequam iam adsum, bracchiis corpus eius amplectens."

# game/a1s7.rpy:414
translate latin a1s7_038a5b15:

    # a "\"Whoa! Hey, [mc]. Everything alright?\""
    a "\"O! Heus, [mc]. Omniane bene sunt?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:415
translate latin a1s7_2a588ab3:

    # "The wolf sets a heavy paw on my head, rubbing the pads gently against my scalp."
    "Lupus gravem pedem anteriorem in capite meo ponit, pulvinulis leniter cutem capitis fricans."

# game/a1s7.rpy:416
translate latin a1s7_7566b0f2:

    # m "\"Are you?\""
    m "\"Tibine?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:418
translate latin a1s7_d098c481:

    # a "\"Of course.\""
    a "\"Certe.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:419
translate latin a1s7_d3427baf:

    # "Amicus smiles down at me warmly, but having known him this long, I know that's not exactly true."
    "Lupus mihi desuper benigne ridet, sed cum eum tamdiu noverim, scio id non prorsus verum esse."

# game/a1s7.rpy:420
translate latin a1s7_0ce9f6c0:

    # m "\"Well...we won.\""
    m "\"Bene...vicimus.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:422
translate latin a1s7_6fdc1b5e:

    # a "\"We did.\""
    a "\"Vicimus quidem.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:423
translate latin a1s7_cb6e1c6d:

    # "He's quiet for a bit, continuing to rub my head."
    "Paulisper tacet, caput meum fricare pergens."

# game/a1s7.rpy:424
translate latin a1s7_c223d1ca:

    # m "\"This isn't really how I imagined it would go.\""
    m "\"Non vere sic rem cessuram imaginatus sum.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:425
translate latin a1s7_e2b0982e:

    # "Amicus laughs softly."
    "Amicus leniter ridet."

# game/a1s7.rpy:427
translate latin a1s7_79ad401d:

    # a "\"Hahaha...neither did I, but we did win, and that's the important part.\""
    a "\"Hahaha...neque ego, sed vicimus, et id est quod interest.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:428
translate latin a1s7_8a5c4276:

    # "Amicus hugs me tightly again."
    "Amicus me rursus artius amplectitur."

# game/a1s7.rpy:429
translate latin a1s7_770e1aec:

    # m "\"Is what Cassius did, what he showed...how bad was that?\""
    m "\"Id quod Cassius fecit, quod ostendit...quam malum erat?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:431
translate latin a1s7_2eb2edb1:

    # "Amicus grimaces."
    "Amicus vultum contrahit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:432
translate latin a1s7_124c2aca:

    # a "\"Bad, but I'll find a way to get through that. Seems my first job as emperor will be rebuilding my image.\""
    a "\"Malum, sed viam inveniam qua id superem. Videtur primum officium meum ut imperatoris futurum esse famam meam reficere.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:433
translate latin a1s7_1a4c4bd0:

    # m "\"When do you become emperor?\""
    m "\"Quando imperator fies?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:435
translate latin a1s7_c8af00c6:

    # a "\"As soon as Cassius gives up. I don't think he's in the mood to do that quite yet, though.\""
    a "\"Simul ac Cassius cesserit. Sed non puto eum id facere iam velle.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:436
translate latin a1s7_e594dc90:

    # "We stand there for a while, Amicus continuing to stroke my head as I lean it against his chest, listening to the soft beat of his heart."
    "Ibi aliquamdiu stamus, Amico caput meum mulcere pergente, dum illud pectori eius appono, lenem cordis eius pulsum audiens."

# game/a1s7.rpy:437
translate latin a1s7_307f10ea:

    # m "\"I'm just glad it's over.\""
    m "\"Tantum gaudeo id finitum esse.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:438
translate latin a1s7_d7c4b152:

    # a "\"I feel the same.\""
    a "\"Idem sentio.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:439
translate latin a1s7_af0371c2:

    # m "\"So what next?\""
    m "\"Quid igitur deinde?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:440
translate latin a1s7_64c79068:

    # a "\"Well...for now, I must go to the city. The triumvirates requested the imperial family be seen at once.\""
    a "\"Bene...nunc in urbem mihi eundum est. Triumviratus petiverunt ut familia imperatoria statim conveniretur.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:441
translate latin a1s7_62a5f071:

    # m "\"Oh, why?\""
    m "\"O, cur?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:442
translate latin a1s7_aa8b0219:

    # a "\"Well, everyone assumes the trials to be over. They'd like to discuss things with the family before they leave Adastra for their own cities.\""
    a "\"Bene, omnes certamina finita esse putant. De rebus cum familia colloqui volunt antequam Adastram relinquunt et ad suas urbes redeunt.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:443
translate latin a1s7_0746d850:

    # m "\"I see.\""
    m "\"Intellego.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:444
translate latin a1s7_b8287671:

    # a "\"They also requested that you go.\""
    a "\"Etiam petiverunt ut tu eas.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:445
translate latin a1s7_b4cd5205:

    # "I lean back to look up at the wolf."
    "Retro me inclino ut lupum suspiciam."

# game/a1s7.rpy:446
translate latin a1s7_0b4eb0fa:

    # m "\"Really?\""
    m "\"Revera?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:447
translate latin a1s7_b9ecf7cf:

    # a "\"Yes, though I told them not to expect it. I know you wanted to see the city, but it's up to you...well, it won't be the actual city, just the district where the delegates live. Things are a bit...chaotic in the city center at the moment.\""
    a "\"Ita, quamquam eis dixi ne id exspectarent. Scio te urbem videre voluisse, sed tu eligis...bene, non ipsa urbs erit, sed regio ubi legati habitant. Res nunc in medio urbis aliquantum...turbatae sunt.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:448
translate latin a1s7_03c9feaa:

    # m "\"Chaotic?\""
    m "\"Turbatae?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:450
translate latin a1s7_2d2120d0:

    # a "\"The citizens are...excited after the trial.\""
    a "\"Cives post certamen...concitati sunt.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:451
translate latin a1s7_d1171c7d:

    # m "\"Ah.\""
    m "\"Ah.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:452
translate latin a1s7_e0f25d9c:

    # "I imagine excited means angry."
    "Puto concitatos iratos significare."

# game/a1s7.rpy:453
translate latin a1s7_11b6403a:

    # m "\"I could...but doing official stuff seems kinda scary.\""
    m "\"Possem...sed negotia publica agere aliquantum formidolosum videtur.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:455
translate latin a1s7_0bce8022:

    # a "\"You wouldn't have to do anything, just look happy to be there, but it's up to you.\""
    a "\"Nihil facere deberes; tantum laetus ibi esse videri, sed tu eligis.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:456
translate latin a1s7_ddede72f:

    # m "\"Would it help you?\""
    m "\"Tibi prodessetne?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:457
translate latin a1s7_5676f217:

    # a "\"Possibly, I would certainly be happy to have you there.\""
    a "\"Fortasse; certe gauderem te ibi habere.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:458
translate latin a1s7_c9e8c18e:

    # m "\"Then sure.\""
    m "\"Tum sane.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:460
translate latin a1s7_876d4665:

    # "The wolf's eyebrows go up in surprise."
    "Supercilia lupi prae admiratione tolluntur."

# game/a1s7.rpy:461
translate latin a1s7_247edc62:

    # a "\"Oh, really? Well alright then. Let's go.\""
    a "\"O, vere? Bene igitur. Eamus.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:462
translate latin a1s7_081cfa8d:

    # m "\"Now?\""
    m "\"Nunc?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:464
translate latin a1s7_1402ad9d:

    # a "\"Yes, I believe the others are already in the chariot. Are you ready?\""
    a "\"Ita, credo ceteros iam in curru esse. Paratus es?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:465
translate latin a1s7_5b074b8d:

    # m "\"I...think so, unless I need to bring anything.\""
    m "\"Ego...credo ita, nisi aliquid ferre debeo.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:466
translate latin a1s7_cb78c075:

    # a "\"Not at all. And sorry, I know things are moving fast at the moment. It's to be expected after the trial, but we can talk in private when we get back, alright?\""
    a "\"Nihil omnino. Et ignosce, scio res nunc celeriter procedere. Post certamen id exspectandum est, sed privatim colloqui possumus cum redierimus, bene?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:467
translate latin a1s7_1f228d29:

    # m "\"Okay.\""
    m "\"Bene.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:470
translate latin a1s7_8411324e:

    # "Amicus is already turning to pull me along, but I stop him."
    "Amicus iam se vertit ut me secum trahat, sed eum sisto."

# game/a1s7.rpy:471
translate latin a1s7_38696d31:

    # "When he turns, I do what I'd wanted to do since right before the trial started, and I kiss him on the lips."
    "Cum se vertit, facio quod facere cupiveram iam paulo ante initium certaminis, et eum in labiis osculor."

# game/a1s7.rpy:474
translate latin a1s7_d02f6420:

    # "The chariot is really just a large, metallic carriage."
    "Currus re vera tantum magna raeda metallica est."

# game/a1s7.rpy:475
translate latin a1s7_4fe4368c:

    # "It has benches inside with an open top."
    "Scamna intus habet et tectum apertum."

# game/a1s7.rpy:476
translate latin a1s7_e8640ed9:

    # "There are no horses, of course, and it seems to move on its own."
    "Nulli equi adsunt, sane, et sua sponte moveri videtur."

# game/a1s7.rpy:477
translate latin a1s7_78f9e51d:

    # "It is the first time that I've ever seen wheels being used for transportation here, though."
    "Tamen primum hic umquam video rotas ad vehendum usurpari."

# game/a1s7.rpy:478
translate latin a1s7_c80b5c1c:

    # "As we're walking up to it, I notice Virginia and Neferu already sitting in the front...and Cassius is in the back with Alex."
    "Dum ad eam ambulamus, Virginiam et Neferu iam in priore parte sedentes animadverto...Cassius autem posteriore cum Alex est."

# game/a1s7.rpy:479
translate latin a1s7_22bc4115:

    # "He's very deliberately looking away from us."
    "Consulto oculos a nobis avertit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:480
translate latin a1s7_63f8c57d:

    # "I whisper to Amicus as we get closer to the chariot."
    "Amico susurro dum ad currum accedimus."

# game/a1s7.rpy:481
translate latin a1s7_3d53d6b9:

    # m "\"Cassius is going?\""
    m "\"Cassiusne it?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:482
translate latin a1s7_166cfa1c:

    # a "\"Yes...I think Cato made him go.\""
    a "\"Ita...credo Catonem eum ire coegisse.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:483
translate latin a1s7_24cb2e4c:

    # "Despite everything the white wolf has done, especially in the trial, I can't help but feel a little sorry for him."
    "Quamquam albus lupus omnia illa fecit, praesertim in certamine, non possum quin paulum eius miserear."

# game/a1s7.rpy:484
translate latin a1s7_55489bc5:

    # "I can't imagine having to go out in public right after your years-long campaign was defeated."
    "Imaginari non possum me in publicum ire debere statim postquam petitio mea, per annos continuata, victa sit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:485
translate latin a1s7_db6d831d:

    # "Amicus hops in first, sitting next to Virginia before reaching down to me to pull me up next to him."
    "Amicus primus insilit et iuxta Virginiam sedet, deinde ad me infra manum porrigit ut me sursum trahat iuxta se."

# game/a1s7.rpy:486
translate latin a1s7_5023fbc7:

    # m "\"I'd thought we'd be flying there.\""
    m "\"Putaveram nos eo volatu ituros esse.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:488
translate latin a1s7_d492f0d7:

    # a "\"We usually do, but since the ship we used to take to the city, uh, crashed a few months ago, we decided the chariot is safer and more inconspicuous.\""
    a "\"Solemus quidem, sed cum navis qua in urbem vehebamur, em, ante paucos menses ceciderit, decrevimus currum tutiorem esse et minus conspicuum.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:490
translate latin a1s7_82f25162:

    # v "\"Yes, something that will come in handy considering the state of the city right now.\""
    v "\"Ita, id utile erit, cum qualis urbis condicio nunc sit consideremus.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:492
translate latin a1s7_bcc81977:

    # a "\"Yes.\""
    a "\"Ita.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:493
translate latin a1s7_ae9ffd95:

    # m "\"What's the state of the city?\""
    m "\"Quae est urbis condicio?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:494
translate latin a1s7_fd1c1e8d:

    # "Virginia fixes her eyes on me, really looking at me for the first time in a while."
    "Virginia oculos in me figit, primum post aliquod tempus me vere intuens."

# game/a1s7.rpy:495
translate latin a1s7_7594914a:

    # v "\"Riots, looting, the usual, though a bit unusual for Adastra City compared to say, Lux.\""
    v "\"Tumultus, direptiones, res solitae, quamquam urbi Adastrae aliquantum insolitae, si exempli gratia cum Lux compares.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:496
translate latin a1s7_54ea977e:

    # "Amicus glances at me, but that's when there's a sudden jerk as the chariot moves forward, toward the tree line."
    "Amicus me breviter intuetur, sed tum subito quatimur dum currus procedit, ad marginem arborum."

# game/a1s7.rpy:498
translate latin a1s7_11dcec16:

    # "Virginia looks at Amicus."
    "Virginia Amicum intuetur."

# game/a1s7.rpy:500
translate latin a1s7_76e10e58:

    # v "\"I must say, your pet is much more fascinating than I'd originally thought. He could barely speak when I first met him.\""
    v "\"Fateor animal tuum domesticum multo admirabilius esse quam initio putabam. Vix loqui poterat cum primum ei occurri.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:502
translate latin a1s7_a8fa2a19:

    # a "\"Erm...yes, he was shy.\""
    a "\"Em...ita, timidus erat.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:503
translate latin a1s7_9cf1ab15:

    # "I guess I should have told Amicus that my act had been exposed at this point."
    "Credo me Amico iam dicere debuisse simulationem meam detectam esse."

# game/a1s7.rpy:504
translate latin a1s7_3e09e91d:

    # v "\"Well, we must reconnect with this Simia, then. They seem oddly intelligent.\""
    v "\"Bene, contactum igitur cum hac Simia renovare debemus. Mire intellegentes videntur.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:506
translate latin a1s7_66a2bd36:

    # a "\"Mmh, yes...Oh, thank the gods for the trees. Vita is much too harsh today.\""
    a "\"Mmh, ita...O, deis gratias propter arbores. Vita hodie nimis vehementer urit.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:507
translate latin a1s7_ad0ba3d7:

    # "Amicus clearly tries to change the subject as the road turns into the thick forest."
    "Amicus manifeste rem de qua loquimur mutare conatur, dum via in densam silvam vertitur."

# game/a1s7.rpy:511
translate latin a1s7_78b409cb:

    # "We're blanketed in an eerie, green glow as the forest envelops us."
    "Miro viridi lumine tegimur, dum silva nos circumdat."

# game/a1s7.rpy:512
translate latin a1s7_845891f4:

    # "Strange, glowing insects fly around our carriage, and I notice how ancient the trees look, gnarled and rough, almost completely blocking out the sky."
    "Mira insecta lucentia circum raedam nostram volant, et animadverto quam antiquae arbores videantur, nodosae et asperae, caelum paene totum occultantes."

# game/a1s7.rpy:513
translate latin a1s7_60926ba4:

    # v "\"Hopefully they allow us to freshen up a bit before the ceremony. I'll be a mess by the time we reach the city.\""
    v "\"Utinam nos ante caerimoniam paulum reficere liceat. Cum ad urbem pervenimus, prorsus incomposita ero.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:514
translate latin a1s7_6d384ca9:

    # "Virginia whips out her large, embroidered fan again, waving it frantically in her face."
    "Virginia magnum flabellum acupictum rursus celeriter profert, coram vultu suo furiose agitans."

# game/a1s7.rpy:515
translate latin a1s7_6d0a9fb3:

    # "I kind of wish I had one too, my skin almost immediately sticky in the humid air."
    "Paulum cupio me quoque tale habere; cutis mea paene statim in aere umido glutinosa fit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:517
translate latin a1s7_b10e23a3:

    # n "\"You will look fine. Besides, we'll all be in the same state.\""
    n "\"Bene videberis. Praeterea omnes in eadem condicione erimus.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:519
translate latin a1s7_fa76d747:

    # "Amicus glances over at the jackal."
    "Amicus ad chacalum breviter respicit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:520
translate latin a1s7_568ae0cb:

    # a "\"I have to wonder what brought you along, Neferu?\""
    a "\"Mirari debeo quid te nobiscum adduxerit, Neferu?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:522
translate latin a1s7_335debfe:

    # n "\"My presence was requested.\""
    n "\"Praesentia mea petita est.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:523
translate latin a1s7_f8748c48:

    # a "\"By whom?\""
    a "\"Cuius iussu?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:525
translate latin a1s7_bff904fd:

    # v "\"Oh, for the sake of Vita, don't start, Amicus.\""
    v "\"O, per Vitam, ne incipias, Amice.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:527
translate latin a1s7_040808ba:

    # a "\"What? I'm simply curious.\""
    a "\"Quid? Tantum curiosus sum.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:528
translate latin a1s7_635ba475:

    # v "\"No, you're trying to start a fight, which is the last thing we need in front of the triumvirates\""
    v "\"Non, pugnam incipere conaris, quae est res qua minime coram triumviris egemus\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:530
translate latin a1s7_706499bc:

    # a "\"Hmph...\""
    a "\"Hmph...\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:532
translate latin a1s7_ac9c7d27:

    # v "\"Besides, isn't your policy to befriend Khemians?\""
    v "\"Praeterea, nonne consilium tuum est Khemianis amicum fieri?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:533
translate latin a1s7_6e1568e6:

    # a "\"An alliance isn't a friendship.\""
    a "\"Societas non est amicitia.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:535
translate latin a1s7_a4409f4f:

    # n "\"Khemians see it as friendship.\""
    n "\"Khemiani eam amicitiam esse vident.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:536
translate latin a1s7_7bad0bcd:

    # v "\"Besides, everyone probably thinks you're already very...close after what was broadcast.\""
    v "\"Praeterea omnes probabiliter putant vos iam valde...intimos esse post ea quae transmissa sunt.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:538
translate latin a1s7_0d89f4a8:

    # a "\"Virginia!\""
    a "\"Virginia!\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:542
translate latin a1s7_69f7317d:

    # "She hides her smirk behind the fan as Neferu grins beside her."
    "Subrisum suum post flabellum celat, dum Neferu iuxta eam late ridet."

# game/a1s7.rpy:544
translate latin a1s7_edbca8b1:

    # v "\"I'm simply reminding you that it might still be fresh in everyone's mind when we get there.\""
    v "\"Tantum te admoneo id adhuc recens in omnium mentibus esse posse cum eo perveniemus.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:546
translate latin a1s7_c6d63285:

    # "Amicus slumps in his seat, legs stretched out in front of him."
    "Amicus in sede inclinatur, cruribus ante se extensis."

# game/a1s7.rpy:547
translate latin a1s7_b942af1b:

    # a "\"All the more reason to seem distant. That will probably affect my reputation for YEARS.\""
    a "\"Eo magis inter nos distare videri debemus. Id famam meam per ANNOS probabiliter afficiet.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:549
translate latin a1s7_6546a08d:

    # v "\"Oh, don't be so dramatic. The people love such scandals, they simply pretend to be outraged.\""
    v "\"O, ne tam scaenicus sis. Populus talia scandala amat; tantum indignari se fingunt.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:550
translate latin a1s7_db9023cf:

    # "Amicus snorts, but doesn't say anything more, signaling that the conversation is over."
    "Amicus per nares flat, sed nihil amplius dicit, significans colloquium finitum esse."

# game/a1s7.rpy:555
translate latin a1s7_dd941d86:

    # "I wonder if Cassius, sitting right behind us, is listening in."
    "Miror an Cassius, recta post nos sedens, colloquium audiat."

# game/a1s7.rpy:556
translate latin a1s7_abc3ff42:

    # "Probably."
    "Probabiliter."

# game/a1s7.rpy:557
translate latin a1s7_d683dd4c:

    # "I find the whole thing strange, the wolf that tried to sabotage Amicus by leaking what was basically a porno sitting right behind us."
    "Tota res mihi mira videtur: lupus qui Amicum laedere conatus est divulgando quod fere pellicula pornographica erat recta post nos sedet."

# game/a1s7.rpy:558
translate latin a1s7_0055b83a:

    # "I turn my head ever so slightly, trying to look back at Cassius to see if he's looking at us."
    "Caput levissime verto, ad Cassium respicere conans ut videam an nos intueatur."

# game/a1s7.rpy:559
translate latin a1s7_40b47330:

    # "I don't see anything, so I turn around more fully and find that the white wolf is laying down, eyes closed with his head in Alex's lap."
    "Nihil video, ita plenius me verto et invenio album lupum iacere, oculis clausis et capite in gremio Alex."

# game/a1s7.rpy:561
translate latin a1s7_6a622acb:

    # "Alex looks up at me and smiles with a wave."
    "Alex ad me suspicit et ridet, manu salutans."

# game/a1s7.rpy:562
translate latin a1s7_8075de1d:

    # "I wave back awkwardly before quickly turning around."
    "Incommode vicissim manu saluto, deinde celeriter me averto."

# game/a1s7.rpy:564
translate latin a1s7_eb04c469:

    # "Virginia and Neferu seemed to be caught up in their own conversation at the moment while Amicus continues to sulk, staring at his feet."
    "Virginia et Neferu nunc suo colloquio occupati videntur, dum Amicus morose tacere pergit, pedes suos fixis oculis intuens."

# game/a1s7.rpy:565
translate latin a1s7_9a227033:

    # m "\"So...what exactly is gonna happen when we get there?\""
    m "\"Itaque...quid prorsus fiet cum eo pervenimus?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:567
translate latin a1s7_dd08919c:

    # a "\"Hm? Oh, well, the meeting with the triumvirates, as I said earlier.\""
    a "\"Hm? O, bene, conventus cum triumviris, ut ante dixi.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:569
translate latin a1s7_eb1f571a:

    # a "\"After that, we'll likely get to walk the streets of the district to visit the shops and a restaurant.\""
    a "\"Postea probabiliter per vias regionis ambulare poterimus, ut tabernas et cauponam visitemus.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:570
translate latin a1s7_02875f3c:

    # m "\"So I'll just stand next to you?\""
    m "\"Ita tantum iuxta te stabo?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:572
translate latin a1s7_bcc81977_1:

    # a "\"Yes.\""
    a "\"Ita.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:573
translate latin a1s7_6f19d038:

    # m "\"Alright.\""
    m "\"Bene.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:575
translate latin a1s7_609247e1:

    # "For the rest of the ride, I lean against Amicus's side, and after several minutes I start to nod off."
    "Per reliquum iter lateri Amici innitor, et post aliquot minuta dormitare incipio."

# game/a1s7.rpy:576
translate latin a1s7_79a3155d:

    # "Amicus notices and wraps an arm around me, and I'm able to comfortably lean against his chest to fall asleep..."
    "Amicus animadvertit et bracchio me amplectitur, et commode pectori eius inniti possum ut obdormiam..."

# game/a1s7.rpy:579
translate latin a1s7_9c3cd0d6:

    # "The next thing I know, I'm being nudged awake by Amicus."
    "Mox Amicus me leviter impellens excitat."

# game/a1s7.rpy:580
translate latin a1s7_c512f657:

    # "I find myself staring at several buildings, the sudden change in scenery leaving me dazed."
    "Aliquot aedificia fixis oculis intueor; subita loci mutatio me attonitum relinquit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:581
translate latin a1s7_6294fa73:

    # "I'm still trying to get my bearings as Amicus hops out of the carriage, reaching up to lift me down."
    "Adhuc locum intellegere conor, dum Amicus e raeda desilit et manum sursum porrigit ut me deponat."

# game/a1s7.rpy:582
translate latin a1s7_980e2499:

    # "When I look back up, I'm able to see a large group of wolves off to the side, watching us intently."
    "Cum rursus suspicio, magnam luporum turbam ad latus videre possum, nos attente spectantem."

# game/a1s7.rpy:583
translate latin a1s7_c36b75f2:

    # "Immediately I feel self-conscious, the crowd being the largest gathering of wolves that I've seen in person."
    "Statim verecundia afficior; haec turba maxima luporum congregatio est quam coram vidi."

# game/a1s7.rpy:584
translate latin a1s7_49942eda:

    # "They come in all shapes and sizes, and I'm surprised to see a few of them that are almost as short as I am."
    "Omni forma et magnitudine sunt, et miror paucos videre paene tam breves quam ego."

# game/a1s7.rpy:585
translate latin a1s7_bed1d95e:

    # "The one characteristic that all of them share though, is their thick-bodied stature."
    "Unum tamen omnibus commune est, statura corporibus crassis."

# game/a1s7.rpy:586
translate latin a1s7_8966a1cb:

    # "Amicus guides me around to stand in front of the chariot with Neferu, Virginia, Cassius, and Alex, holding me close to his side."
    "Amicus me circumducit ut ante currum cum Neferu, Virginia, Cassio et Alex stem, prope latus suum me tenens."

# game/a1s7.rpy:587
translate latin a1s7_aaed98c2:

    # "One of the old wolves steps forward from the group."
    "Unus e senibus lupis ex turba procedit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:589
translate latin a1s7_87dd569a:

    # "Triumvirate" "\"Welcome imperial family! Thank you so much for coming on this day of the second trial. It was a marvelous show!\""
    "Triumvirate" "\"Salvete, familia imperatoria! Maximas gratias quod hoc die secundi certaminis venistis. Mirificum spectaculum erat!\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:590
translate latin a1s7_14f45c21:

    # "That seems like a bold thing to say after a clip of Neferu and Amicus having sex was shown."
    "Id audax dictum videtur postquam pars pelliculae Neferu et Amicum concumbentes ostendit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:591
translate latin a1s7_e749d230:

    # "There doesn't seem to be any awkwardness though, the old wolves looking eager to talk to Amicus."
    "Nulla tamen verecundia esse videtur; senes lupi cupidi cum Amico loquendi videntur."

# game/a1s7.rpy:592
translate latin a1s7_6a5df033:

    # "Triumvirate" "\"I am Cicero, First Triumvirate of Ad Rotae.\""
    "Triumvirate" "\"Cicero sum, Primus Triumvir urbis Ad Rotae.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:593
translate latin a1s7_888f668e:

    # "The old wolf walks forward toward Amicus, setting his paws on the bigger wolf's shoulders and touching the sides of their muzzles together."
    "Senex lupus ad Amicum procedit, pedes anteriores in maioris lupi umeris ponit et latera rostrorum suorum inter se contingunt."

# game/a1s7.rpy:594
translate latin a1s7_1ce73784:

    # "Out of the corner of my eye, I notice Cassius shooting us a sour, angry look."
    "Ex extremo oculo Cassium nos acerbo iratoque obtutu petentem animadverto."

# game/a1s7.rpy:595
translate latin a1s7_02a822a7:

    # "The wolf and Amicus hold a short conversation, the older wolf asking Amicus what he thought of Ad Rotae, what problems the city was currently having, and how they might proceed in the future."
    "Lupus et Amicus breviter colloquuntur; senior lupus Amicum rogat quid de Ad Rotae sentiat, quibus difficultatibus urbs nunc laboret et quomodo posthac agere possint."

# game/a1s7.rpy:596
translate latin a1s7_bd3faa0b:

    # "After that, he then he moves on to Virginia where the conversation is much shorter."
    "Postea ad Virginiam transit, ubi colloquium multo brevius est."

# game/a1s7.rpy:597
translate latin a1s7_0d21d42a:

    # "Another wolf from the group moves forward to talk to Amicus, the conversation following a roughly similar pattern."
    "Alter lupus e turba procedit ut cum Amico loquatur; colloquium similem fere ordinem sequitur."

# game/a1s7.rpy:598
translate latin a1s7_60f1d351:

    # "There's no talk about Amicus being emperor, but the assumption is there, and when each of them gets to Cassius, it's almost as equally brief as it was with Virginia."
    "Non loquuntur de Amico imperatore, sed id tacite sumunt, et cum quisque ad Cassium pervenit, colloquium paene aeque breve est ac cum Virginia fuit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:599
translate latin a1s7_6523d889:

    # "Despite the novelty of this situation, I quickly become bored, and the conversations blend together very quickly as over a dozen of these old wolves come forward to introduce themselves to Amicus."
    "Quamquam res nova est, celeriter taedio afficior, et colloquia mox confunduntur, dum plus quam duodecim ex his senibus lupis procedunt ut se Amico praesentent."

# game/a1s7.rpy:600
translate latin a1s7_451b884d:

    # "For his part, Amicus does a really good job of seeming enthusiastic for each introduction, mentioning that he already knows who they are and that he thinks very, very highly of their city and region."
    "Amicus vero optime agit, ad singulas salutationes alacritatem ostendens, dicens se iam scire qui sint et urbem regionemque eorum maximi, maximi aestimare."

# game/a1s7.rpy:601
translate latin a1s7_b13d29f9:

    # "Occasionally, they'll glance at me and comment on how strange I look, though it's usually with a positive tone, congratulating Amicus on snagging me."
    "Interdum me breviter intuentur et quam mirus aspectu sim dicunt, quamquam plerumque benigna voce, Amico gratulantes quod me ceperit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:602
translate latin a1s7_4cd478ce:

    # "That does seem to make Amicus uncomfortable, but I keep a straight face and bow each time, seeming to delight the old wolves with my etiquette."
    "Id Amicum incommodum facere videtur, sed vultum gravem servo et singulis vicibus inclino, ita ut senes lupos meis moribus delectare videar."

# game/a1s7.rpy:603
translate latin a1s7_a0632b7d:

    # "Eventually, these introductions end, but as we start to move toward the shops, the triumvirates continue to follow us, and I find myself having a harder time keeping up with Amicus."
    "Tandem hae salutationes finiuntur, sed cum ad tabernas ire incipimus, triumviri nos sequi pergunt, et difficilius mihi fit cum Amico pari passu ire."

# game/a1s7.rpy:604
translate latin a1s7_5773bfdb:

    # "He's practically surrounded by the triumvirates."
    "Paene a triumviris circumdatus est."

# game/a1s7.rpy:605
translate latin a1s7_8f5d4fd4:

    # "I give up on trying to stay next to him, and even though he keeps glancing at me and calls to me a few times, I just wave him on, choosing instead to walk alongside Neferu and Virginia."
    "Desino iuxta eum manere conari, et quamquam me intueri pergit et aliquoties me vocat, manu eum pergere iubeo, potius iuxta Neferu et Virginiam ambulans."

# game/a1s7.rpy:606
translate latin a1s7_8b761cc9:

    # "Sure, it's annoying, but he's about to become emperor, so it makes sense that he's so popular."
    "Sane molestum est, sed mox imperator fiet, ita rationi consentaneum est eum tam gratum esse."

# game/a1s7.rpy:607
translate latin a1s7_13b6c96f:

    # "As we walk through the streets, wolves call out to Amicus from doorways and windows, and he tries to wave at all of them."
    "Dum per vias ambulamus, lupi ex ianuis et fenestris Amicum vocant, et ille omnibus manu salutare conatur."

# game/a1s7.rpy:608
translate latin a1s7_b5937a14:

    # "Further up the road, a group of children...puppies show up with flowers in their paws, handing them out to Amicus and the triumvirates."
    "Paulo longius in via turba puerorum...catulorum apparet cum floribus in pedibus anterioribus, eos Amico et triumviris dans."

# game/a1s7.rpy:609
translate latin a1s7_07acea1e:

    # "As I watch this happening, I notice a particularly patchy-looking child, no taller than my waist standing off to the side awkwardly, looking right at me as she holds a flower in her paws."
    "Dum haec specto, puellam praesertim pilis inaequalibus animadverto, non altiorem quam lumbos meos, incommode ad latus stantem, recta me intuentem dum florem pedibus anterioribus tenet."

# game/a1s7.rpy:611
translate latin a1s7_9914a9ce:

    # "I pause, unsure if she means to give it to me."
    "Consisto, incertus an mihi eum dare velit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:612
translate latin a1s7_c4ec6f77:

    # "When I do, she moves closer."
    "Cum consisto, propius accedit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:613
translate latin a1s7_8f464365:

    # "So I bend over, reaching out and her eyes widen, probably simultaneously horrified and fascinated at getting the crazy alien's attention."
    "Ita me inclino et manum porrigo; oculi eius dilatantur, probabiliter simul horrentis et mirantis quod mirus alienus eam animadverterit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:614
translate latin a1s7_33026450:

    # "Nevertheless, she comes closer and shyly pushes the crumpled, wilted flower into my hands before suddenly leaning in and touching the side of her face to mine."
    "Tamen propius accedit et timide contritum marcidumque florem in manus meas impellit, deinde subito se inclinat et latus vultus sui meo admovet."

# game/a1s7.rpy:615
translate latin a1s7_891beb11:

    # "For a moment, I see her watery, bloodshot eyes."
    "Paulisper oculos eius lacrimosos et sanguine suffusos video."

# game/a1s7.rpy:616
translate latin a1s7_b051c556:

    # "Then I feel the slightly damp fur brush my skin before she makes an odd yelping sound and runs off down the street."
    "Tum pilos paulum umidos cutem meam radentes sentio, deinde mirum ululatum facit et per viam fugit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:617
translate latin a1s7_f447edce:

    # "I stare after her, wondering if I'd done something wrong."
    "Eam abeuntem fixis oculis intueor, mirans an aliquid perperam fecerim."

# game/a1s7.rpy:619
translate latin a1s7_0669a9c7:

    # n "\"Found yourself a gift?\""
    n "\"Donum tibi invenisti?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:620
translate latin a1s7_2928ab92:

    # "I look down at the white flower, noticing that several petals are missing."
    "Album florem desuper intueor, animadvertens aliquot petala deesse."

# game/a1s7.rpy:621
translate latin a1s7_b8d48463:

    # m "\"I guess.\""
    m "\"Credo ita.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:623
translate latin a1s7_7ea3b417:

    # n "\"That one didn't look healthy, did she?\""
    n "\"Illa sana non videbatur, nonne?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:624
translate latin a1s7_3a1f371a:

    # m "\"Not really.\""
    m "\"Non sane.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:625
translate latin a1s7_a6bc2c1c:

    # n "\"Maybe Cassius had a point with his speech.\""
    n "\"Fortasse Cassius in oratione sua aliquid recte dixit.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:626
translate latin a1s7_24e04e46:

    # m "\"I think they both made good points, honestly.\""
    m "\"Puto ambos bona argumenta protulisse, ut verum dicam.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:627
translate latin a1s7_1eb07fc1:

    # "Neferu gestures at the gaggle of wolves moving further and further away from us."
    "Neferu turbam luporum demonstrat, quae longius longiusque a nobis abit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:629
translate latin a1s7_e8963ddd:

    # n "\"Better catch up before they leave us behind.\""
    n "\"Melius erit eos assequi antequam nos relinquant.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:630
translate latin a1s7_c806ebc0:

    # m "\"Yeah.\""
    m "\"Ita.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:632
translate latin a1s7_2550580e:

    # "I look down at the flower again, a bit uneasy now, before dropping it to the road, feeling a little guilty as I do."
    "Florem rursus desuper intueor, iam paulum sollicitus, deinde eum in viam demitto, aliquantum culpae sentiens dum id facio."

# game/a1s7.rpy:635
translate latin a1s7_70f849c4:

    # "Even though the ceremony is technically over, the triumvirates don't seem to want to leave Amicus alone."
    "Quamquam caerimonia re ipsa finita est, triumviri Amicum solum relinquere nolle videntur."

# game/a1s7.rpy:636
translate latin a1s7_6a1ab172:

    # "I'm kind of amazed at how well Amicus is dealing with them considering how irritated I'm feeling."
    "Paulum miror quam bene Amicus cum eis agat, cum ipse tam vexatus sim."

# game/a1s7.rpy:637
translate latin a1s7_640e721d:

    # "Amicus tries to bring me over to his side a few times, pointing out trinkets and souvenirs that he tries to explain, as if wanting to show me a bit of Adastran culture."
    "Amicus aliquoties me ad latus suum ducere conatur, ornamenta et rerum memorabilium dona monstrans quae explicare conatur, quasi mihi aliquid cultus Adastrae ostendere velit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:638
translate latin a1s7_99cfb85b:

    # "It's nice, and I can tell he wants to involve me, but it's far too busy with triumvirates and locals breaking in every five seconds to ask or tell Amicus something."
    "Iucundum est, et intellegere possum eum velle me participem facere, sed nimis tumultuosum est, cum triumviri et incolae singulis quinque secundis interveniant ut aliquid Amicum rogent aut ei dicant."

# game/a1s7.rpy:639
translate latin a1s7_49a63abb:

    # "I wish he could just tell them to go away, but I know it doesn't work like that."
    "Cupio eum tantum eis discedere iubere posse, sed scio res non ita agi."

# game/a1s7.rpy:640
translate latin a1s7_f07d200c:

    # "On top of this, my joints are really starting to ache from all the walking and I wonder if living in the palace for so long has made me soft."
    "Praeterea articuli mei propter tantam ambulationem vere dolere incipiunt, et miror an tamdiu in palatio vivere me mollem fecerit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:641
translate latin a1s7_458be7a2:

    # "Eventually, I just trail the group of wolves, browsing the goods after they do."
    "Tandem tantum turbam luporum sequor, merces post eos contemplans."

# game/a1s7.rpy:642
translate latin a1s7_557714b9:

    # "It's interesting, sure, but everything's so similar to what we have on Earth: necklaces, earrings, brushes, clothes, nothing all that mind-blowing."
    "Res quidem curiosae sunt, sed omnia tam similia iis sunt quae in Terra habemus: monilia, inaures, peniculi, vestes, nihil quod magnopere animum stupefaciat."

# game/a1s7.rpy:643
translate latin a1s7_164b35f5:

    # "Eventually, Amicus very loudly calls out that he'd like to go to a restaurant with his pet, if everyone could please allow him through."
    "Tandem Amicus magna voce clamat se cum animali suo domestico ad cauponam ire velle, si omnes quaeso eum transire sinant."

# game/a1s7.rpy:644
translate latin a1s7_b9ee2dfb:

    # "I take this as my cue to move to his side and he immediately puts an arm around mine, holding me close."
    "Id signum mihi esse intellego ut ad latus eius veniam, et statim bracchium circa meum ponit, me prope tenens."

# game/a1s7.rpy:645
translate latin a1s7_852764cc:

    # "As we walk up the street (the many wolves still following behind us) Amicus puts his muzzle close to my ear, sending a bit of a chill over my neck...one that's oddly painful."
    "Dum per viam ambulamus, multis lupis adhuc post nos sequentibus, Amicus rostrum prope aurem meam admovet, paulum frigoris per cervicem mittens...quod mire dolet."

# game/a1s7.rpy:647
translate latin a1s7_ac20bf21:

    # a "\"Everything okay, [mc]? You seem a bit...uncomfortable.\""
    a "\"Omniane bene sunt, [mc]? Paulum...incommodus videris.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:648
translate latin a1s7_8619f2c6:

    # "I shrug."
    "Umeros tollo."

# game/a1s7.rpy:649
translate latin a1s7_97ebe39c:

    # m "\"Everything around here is new to me, so I guess I do feel a little bit off.\""
    m "\"Omnia hic mihi nova sunt, ita credo me paulum insuete sentire.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:651
translate latin a1s7_4ac460f5:

    # a "\"Well, let's settle down in a restaurant. We can cool off and catch our breath there.\""
    a "\"Bene, in caupona quiescamus. Ibi refrigerari et spiritum recipere possumus.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:652
translate latin a1s7_61dec44e:

    # "The wolf gives me a quick squeeze with his arm, and despite my slightly sour mood, I can't help but smile a bit."
    "Lupus me bracchio breviter stringit, et quamquam aliquantum morosus sum, non possum quin paulum rideam."

# game/a1s7.rpy:653
translate latin a1s7_9a429f0a:

    # "I mean, it is kind of cool that my friend is so popular...even if it's because he's going to be the next emperor."
    "Hoc volo dicere: satis iucundum est amicum meum tam gratum esse...etiamsi quia proximus imperator futurus est."

# game/a1s7.rpy:656
translate latin a1s7_d8d176b5:

    # "We walk into a small, but cozy restaurant, and I can tell right away that it's rather upscale with its carved pillars, and the fancy tapestries on the wall."
    "Parvam sed commodam cauponam intramus, et statim intellegere possum eam satis lautam esse, columnis sculptis et splendidis aulaeis in pariete."

# game/a1s7.rpy:657
translate latin a1s7_2e0d1651:

    # "Then again, everything in this district is kind of upscale, I guess."
    "Quamquam omnia in hac regione satis lauta sunt, credo."

# game/a1s7.rpy:658
translate latin a1s7_f8946d59:

    # "The triumvirates follow us right into the restaurant though, and I let out a frustrated sigh."
    "Triumviratus tamen nos recta in cauponam sequuntur, et vexatus suspirium emitto."

# game/a1s7.rpy:659
translate latin a1s7_1b082c70:

    # "Amicus notices right away and signals at a wolf standing behind a podium."
    "Amicus statim animadvertit et lupo post pluteum stanti signum dat."

# game/a1s7.rpy:660
translate latin a1s7_04f7cd6e:

    # "This particular wolf is staring at us wide-eyed, apparently gob smacked at seeing the soon-to-be emperor show up in his restaurant."
    "Hic lupus nos oculis dilatatis intuetur, manifeste attonitus quod eum qui mox imperator erit in caupona sua videat."

# game/a1s7.rpy:661
translate latin a1s7_c718fb3a:

    # "He practically trips over himself to get to us, banging his hip on the side of a table as he does."
    "Paene ipse sibi offendit ut ad nos perveniat, coxam ad latus mensae feriens dum accedit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:662
translate latin a1s7_6eba0f0c:

    # "Wolf" "\"Y-y-y-yes, your, uh, your....uh, majesty?\""
    "Wolf" "\"I-i-i-ita, tua, em, tua....em, maiestas?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:663
translate latin a1s7_2eb2edb1_1:

    # "Amicus grimaces."
    "Amicus vultum contrahit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:664
translate latin a1s7_7f249c15:

    # a "\"Just Amicus, please. Could you get us a secluded table, preferably with no one seated next to us.\""
    a "\"Tantum Amicus, quaeso. Potesne nobis mensam remotam dare, potissimum ubi nemo iuxta nos sedeat?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:665
translate latin a1s7_b6184670:

    # "\"Of course!\""
    "\"Profecto!\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:666
translate latin a1s7_b6fd5362:

    # "The wolf stumbles over himself again before leading us to a corner of the restaurant, gesturing at a table there."
    "Lupus rursus paene sibi offendit, deinde nos ad angulum cauponae ducit, mensam ibi demonstrans."

# game/a1s7.rpy:667
translate latin a1s7_70d29c90:

    # "He then turns to a couple next to the table and begins to frantically hiss at them to move."
    "Tum ad duos iuxta mensam sedentes se vertit et eis furiose sibilare incipit ut se moveant."

# game/a1s7.rpy:668
translate latin a1s7_67cdb073:

    # "They stare at him in astonishment until Amicus steps in to stop him."
    "Illi eum attoniti intuentur, donec Amicus intervenit ut eum sistat."

# game/a1s7.rpy:669
translate latin a1s7_b63da511:

    # a "\"They're fine, just uh, don't let any of...that group over there sit next to us, if that's alright?\""
    a "\"Illi bene sunt; tantum, em, ne quemquam ex...illa turba illic iuxta nos sedere siveris, si tibi placet?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:670
translate latin a1s7_362ecf2e:

    # "Amicus jerks his head over at the gaggle of old wolves, all of them staring at us rather hawkishly."
    "Amicus capite celeriter ad turbam senum luporum significat, qui omnes nos satis acriter intuentur."

# game/a1s7.rpy:671
translate latin a1s7_e429d193:

    # "\"Oh, yes, of course!\""
    "\"O, ita, sane!\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:672
translate latin a1s7_383071c1:

    # "He hurries off toward said group and we're finally able to sit down...or lay down. "
    "Ad dictam turbam festinat, et tandem sedere possumus...aut iacere."

# game/a1s7.rpy:674
translate latin a1s7_373bda81:

    # "The seats are of course in the Roman style."
    "Sedes sane more Romano sunt."

# game/a1s7.rpy:675
translate latin a1s7_667902a1:

    # "Amicus settles down with a huge sigh, stretching his big body over the bed."
    "Amicus ingenti suspirio recumbit, magnum corpus suum per lectum extendens."

# game/a1s7.rpy:677
translate latin a1s7_e793e83a:

    # a "\"Sorry about that. I should have warned you about how...frustrating it can be with all the pointless chatter.\""
    a "\"Ignosce propter id. Te monere debebam quam...molestum esse possit cum tot vanis colloquiis.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:679
translate latin a1s7_8619f2c6_1:

    # "I shrug."
    "Umeros tollo."

# game/a1s7.rpy:680
translate latin a1s7_2e751642:

    # m "\"Seems about right for politics.\""
    m "\"Rebus publicis satis convenire videtur.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:681
translate latin a1s7_707304f5:

    # a "\"Oh, it is, but don't worry, it's rare that all the triumvirates are in the city all at once. This is for the trials, of course.\""
    a "\"O, convenit, sed ne time: raro omnes triumviri simul in urbe sunt. Hoc certaminum causa fit, sane.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:682
translate latin a1s7_cde4215d:

    # m "\"Yeah, makes sense.\""
    m "\"Ita, rationi consentaneum est.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:683
translate latin a1s7_1875e30b:

    # a "\"You sure you're okay? I can never seem to tell.\""
    a "\"Certus es te bene valere? Numquam discernere posse videor.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:684
translate latin a1s7_d2575e0d:

    # m "\"I'm fine.\""
    m "\"Bene valeo.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:685
translate latin a1s7_c334819a:

    # "I rub my arms, the skin sensitive and sore, just like my joints."
    "Bracchia mea frico, cute sensibili et dolente, sicut articuli mei."

# game/a1s7.rpy:686
translate latin a1s7_bacc3ca9:

    # "I wonder if I'm getting sunburned too."
    "Miror an etiam sole urar."

# game/a1s7.rpy:687
translate latin a1s7_1467de10:

    # a "\"Alright...so what do you think of the city? This part of it at least. I wish I could take you to where the skyscrapers are, but as I said, things are a bit chaotic at the moment.\""
    a "\"Bene...quid de urbe censes? Saltem de hac parte eius. Cupio te ducere posse ubi aedificia altissima sunt, sed, ut dixi, res nunc aliquantum turbatae sunt.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:688
translate latin a1s7_5408fcf9:

    # m "\"It's pretty cool. It wouldn't exactly be out of place on Earth, definitely different, but really similar.\""
    m "\"Satis iucunda est. Non prorsus aliena in Terra videretur; certe diversa, sed valde similis.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:689
translate latin a1s7_f72f3d92:

    # a "\"Ah, well, you were uplifted by us after all.\""
    a "\"Ah, bene, tamen a nobis ad altiorem cultum provecti estis.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:690
translate latin a1s7_c1001af6:

    # m "\"...Yeah. So is this what you're gonna do as emperor? Come to the city and just...talk?\""
    m "\"...Ita. Hocne igitur ut imperator facies? In urbem venire et tantum...loqui?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:691
translate latin a1s7_292c202c:

    # "Amicus chuckles."
    "Amicus leniter ridet."

# game/a1s7.rpy:692
translate latin a1s7_b69f11fc:

    # a "\"Oh, there will be much more to it, I'm sure. I'm hoping Cato will teach me a bit...if he's able to get over the trial.\""
    a "\"O, multo plura erunt, certus sum. Spero Catonem me aliquid docturum esse...si certamen superare potest.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:693
translate latin a1s7_4894d576:

    # "I remember that Cato did vote for Cassius."
    "Memini Catonem Cassio suffragium dedisse."

# game/a1s7.rpy:694
translate latin a1s7_fcc840e3:

    # "He's probably furious about it right now."
    "Nunc probabiliter de eo furiosus est."

# game/a1s7.rpy:695
translate latin a1s7_51af69e5:

    # m "\"Won't you have like, advisors and stuff?\""
    m "\"Nonne consiliarios aliaque talia habebis?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:696
translate latin a1s7_650f6eb0:

    # a "\"Well, yes, but I must choose them.\""
    a "\"Bene, ita, sed mihi eligendi sunt.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:697
translate latin a1s7_4cdc9e27:

    # m "\"Would you choose Cato?\""
    m "\"Catonemne eligeres?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:698
translate latin a1s7_e5c8fcc8:

    # a "\"I could.\""
    a "\"Possem.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:699
translate latin a1s7_8c4b036f:

    # m "\"Will you?\""
    m "\"Faciesne?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:700
translate latin a1s7_d004f5cc:

    # a "\"Well...maybe, but recent events have left me a bit unsure of that.\""
    a "\"Bene...fortasse, sed res nuper gestae me de eo aliquantum incertum reliquerunt.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:701
translate latin a1s7_51e734c7:

    # m "\"Why's that?\""
    m "\"Cur?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:702
translate latin a1s7_3122b23f:

    # "Amicus shakes his head."
    "Amicus caput quatit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:703
translate latin a1s7_f53181f3:

    # a "\"Don't worry about it now, we should be celebrating.\""
    a "\"Nunc de eo ne solliciteris; celebrare debemus.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:704
translate latin a1s7_bd93b343:

    # m "\"I mean, you could become emperor at any moment. Shouldn't you have someone who's got a good head on their shoulders at the ready?\""
    m "\"Hoc volo dicere: quolibet momento imperator fieri potes. Nonne aliquem prudentem paratum habere debes?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:705
translate latin a1s7_dad777b0:

    # a "\"Heh, I suppose. Who would you suggest?\""
    a "\"Heh, credo ita. Quem suadeas?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:706
translate latin a1s7_3f3c4a24:

    # "I get the feeling that he's goading me to offer myself, but that definitely wouldn't be the case."
    "Sentio eum me incitare ut me ipsum offeram, sed id certe non fieret."

# game/a1s7.rpy:707
translate latin a1s7_f27d6391:

    # "The few wolves I know makes the decision pretty easy."
    "Cum paucos lupos noverim, electio satis facilis est."

# game/a1s7.rpy:708
translate latin a1s7_91af5c32:

    # m "\"Virginia.\""
    m "\"Virginia.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:709
translate latin a1s7_e9df507f:

    # "Amicus raises his eyebrows in slight surprise."
    "Amicus supercilia paulum miratus tollit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:710
translate latin a1s7_5d34cbdf:

    # a "\"Oh...well, yes, I would definitely consider her. The only problem is the image of a female telling me what do do. The tail-raiser reputation is bad enough.\""
    a "\"O...bene, ita, de ea certe cogitarem. Sola difficultas est quomodo videatur feminam mihi imperare quid faciam. Fama caudam attollentis iam satis mala est.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:711
translate latin a1s7_46b7b77a:

    # "I roll my eyes."
    "Oculos volvo."

# game/a1s7.rpy:712
translate latin a1s7_abf60d8b:

    # m "\"Maybe wolven masculinity is something you can fix while you're emperor?\""
    m "\"Fortasse virilitas luporum aliquid est quod, dum imperator es, corrigere potes?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:713
translate latin a1s7_c98a5df5:

    # "Amicus doesn't seem to know how to answer that, but he doesn't have to as our food arrives."
    "Amicus nescire videtur quomodo respondeat, sed non debet, quia cibus noster advenit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:714
translate latin a1s7_6d37a35c:

    # "I'm a bit surprised since we didn't order, but looking around, it seems that everyone gets the same thing."
    "Paulum miror, quia nihil petivimus, sed circumspiciens video omnes idem accipere."

# game/a1s7.rpy:716
translate latin a1s7_6c0110e6:

    # "There's the usual olives, grapes, cheese, and bread, but also seafood, and even eggs which surprises me."
    "Adsunt solitae olivae, uvae, caseus et panis, sed etiam cibi marini atque ova quoque, quod me mirari facit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:717
translate latin a1s7_b2962577:

    # "Amicus thanks the nervous waiter before immediately starting to dig in."
    "Amicus ministro sollicito gratias agit, deinde statim avide edere incipit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:718
translate latin a1s7_96fdff41:

    # "I do the same, but while I'm spreading cheese onto the bread, my mind wanders back to what might be happening in the city right now."
    "Idem facio, sed dum caseum in panem inungo, mens mea ad ea redit quae nunc in urbe fieri possint."

# game/a1s7.rpy:719
translate latin a1s7_259d1fdf:

    # m "\"So...how bad are things in the city? No one seems that concerned about it.\""
    m "\"Itaque...quam malae sunt res in urbe? Nemo tam sollicitus de eo videtur.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:720
translate latin a1s7_bc2bfd46:

    # a "\"From what I've been told, it's fairly mild. Riots are common in Adastra, but they don't last long. I think the people will calm down within the next few days.\""
    a "\"Ex iis quae mihi dicta sunt, satis leves sunt. Tumultus in Adastra communes sunt, sed non diu durant. Puto populum intra proximos paucos dies sedatum iri.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:721
translate latin a1s7_fdfe22ba:

    # m "\"Oh, okay. So they don't like...dislike you, or anything?\""
    m "\"O, bene. Ita non quasi...te oderunt, aut aliquid tale?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:722
translate latin a1s7_2105882c:

    # "It takes Amicus a moment to swallow down his mouthful of bread before speaking."
    "Amico paulisper opus est ut panem quo os plenum est deglutiat antequam loquatur."

# game/a1s7.rpy:723
translate latin a1s7_93da756b:

    # a "\"No, no, most of the anger is directed at the triumvirates. I will say though, I have my work cut out in rebuilding my reputation.\""
    a "\"Non, non, maxima pars irae adversus triumviros dirigitur. Dicam tamen multum mihi laboris esse famam meam reficiendi.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:724
translate latin a1s7_f379df11:

    # m "\"Because of the sex video?\""
    m "\"Propter pelliculam concubitus?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:725
translate latin a1s7_f49498ee:

    # a "\"Heh...yes.\""
    a "\"Heh...ita.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:726
translate latin a1s7_0e943416:

    # "Amicus tries to smile it off light-heartedly, but I can see his ears turning red."
    "Amicus rem risu levare conatur, sed aures eius rubescere videre possum."

# game/a1s7.rpy:727
translate latin a1s7_3df2b5fb:

    # "It must be weird being out in public like this, knowing that everyone saw it."
    "Mirum esse debet ita in publico esse, sciens omnes id vidisse."

# game/a1s7.rpy:728
translate latin a1s7_edef4c47:

    # a "\"I was told by one of the triumvirates from Lux to simply say it was fake...not sure if that will work.\""
    a "\"Unus e triumviris urbis Lux mihi dixit ut tantum dicerem falsam esse...nescio an id valiturum sit.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:729
translate latin a1s7_2dd7d6e2:

    # m "\"Could be a good idea.\""
    m "\"Bonum consilium esse potest.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:730
translate latin a1s7_71c699f1:

    # a "\"Really, the biggest issue is that it delegitimizes the alliance process with the Khemians. The people will believe that I'm beholden to Neferu somehow.\""
    a "\"Re vera maxima difficultas est quod fidem tollit processus societatis cum Khemianis constituendae. Populus credet me aliquo modo Neferu obligatum esse.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:731
translate latin a1s7_efb6f58f:

    # "Amicus's expression finally falls a bit, staring down at the food as his munching slows down."
    "Vultus Amici tandem paulum tristior fit; cibum desuper fixis oculis intuetur, dum lentius manducat."

# game/a1s7.rpy:733
translate latin a1s7_7b30c87d:

    # m "\"I'm sure they'll get over it. From what I've been told, it seems like they're quick to forget.\""
    m "\"Certus sum eos hoc superaturos esse. Ex iis quae mihi dicta sunt, cito oblivisci videntur.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:734
translate latin a1s7_0ce42b79:

    # a "\"Well yes, as soon as the next scandal comes along, hopefully one not involving me.\""
    a "\"Bene, ita, simul ac proximum scandalum advenit, ut spero tale quod me non involvit.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:735
translate latin a1s7_c806ebc0_1:

    # m "\"Yeah.\""
    m "\"Ita.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:736
translate latin a1s7_789de3ca:

    # "We eat in silence a while, and I can tell something heavy is on Amicus's mind."
    "Aliquamdiu taciti edimus, et intellegere possum aliquid grave Amici animo esse."

# game/a1s7.rpy:737
translate latin a1s7_39314899:

    # "In the meantime, I'm a bit distracted with itching specific spots on my arms, feeling tiny little bumps on the skin."
    "Interea paulum distrahor dum certos locos bracchiorum scalpo, minimos tuberculos in cute sentiens."

# game/a1s7.rpy:738
translate latin a1s7_4b062d79:

    # "I wonder if I'm allergic to something in the meal, so I stop eating for the moment, choosing instead to lounge out on the bed."
    "Miror an aliquid in cibo allergiam mihi moveat, ita nunc edere desino et potius per lectum recumbo."

# game/a1s7.rpy:739
translate latin a1s7_b2a95ef4:

    # a "\"[mc], I've been meaning to ask you something.\""
    a "\"[mc], aliquid te rogare volebam.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:740
translate latin a1s7_9b78ca0f:

    # m "\"Yeah?\""
    m "\"Quid?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:741
translate latin a1s7_eb7e0d04:

    # a "\"Do you...do you want to stay here, even after I become emperor?\""
    a "\"Visne...visne hic manere, etiam postquam imperator factus ero?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:742
translate latin a1s7_6968d9c1:

    # "The question catches me by surprise, and I'm left to try and gather my thoughts for a moment as Amicus continues to look down."
    "Quaestio me improvisum capit, et paulisper cogitationes colligere conor dum Amicus oculos demittere pergit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:743
translate latin a1s7_27b3b93d:

    # m "\"Um, what do you mean?\""
    m "\"Em, quid vis dicere?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:744
translate latin a1s7_af12ab80:

    # "Amicus sighs and glances at me."
    "Amicus suspirat et me breviter intuetur."

# game/a1s7.rpy:745
translate latin a1s7_6b71aba2:

    # a "\"I mean, do you want to stay here with me, even if you have the ability to go home.\""
    a "\"Hoc volo dicere: visne hic mecum manere, etiam si domum redire possis.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:746
translate latin a1s7_f1b1f7e4:

    # "Amicus quickly looks down again."
    "Amicus celeriter rursus oculos demittit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:747
translate latin a1s7_99875faa:

    # a "\"I'm sorry, I know it's not my place to ask, but...I thought I might as well ask.\""
    a "\"Ignosce, scio non esse meum rogare, sed...putabam me tamen rogare posse.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:748
translate latin a1s7_e352264b:

    # "I stare at him for a moment, then I look down too."
    "Eum paulisper fixis oculis intueor, deinde ego quoque oculos demitto."

# game/a1s7.rpy:749
translate latin a1s7_b27d995e:

    # m "\"You know I need to go back. At the very least I need to let my friends and family know that I'm okay. I know that they're looking for me in Italy right now...probably all of Europe at this point. I need to let them know.\""
    m "\"Scis me redire debere. Saltem amicis et familiae meae indicare debeo me bene valere. Scio eos nunc in Italia me quaerere...probabiliter iam per totam Europam. Eis indicare debeo.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:750
translate latin a1s7_3c87a457:

    # "Amicus coughs hastily."
    "Amicus festinanter tussit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:751
translate latin a1s7_d098c481_1:

    # a "\"Of course.\""
    a "\"Certe.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:752
translate latin a1s7_4b297eeb:

    # m "\"But...that doesn't mean that I don't want to come back. I do. I just know that it's....that there are problems.\""
    m "\"Sed...id non significat me huc redire nolle. Volo. Tantum scio id esse....difficultates esse.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:753
translate latin a1s7_b8dd5c52:

    # "I lower my voice as I remember that we're in a public place and that mentioning illegal First Contact would not be a good idea."
    "Vocem submitto, cum meminerim nos in loco publico esse nec Primam Occursionem illicitam commemorare bonum consilium fore."

# game/a1s7.rpy:754
translate latin a1s7_0bc8e51c:

    # m "\"If we can fix the problems, honestly...I'd love to come back and stay for a long time.\""
    m "\"Si difficultates corrigere possumus, ut verum dicam...libentissime huc redirem et diu manerem.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:755
translate latin a1s7_7107c517:

    # "I kind of surprise myself with that statement, but it's true."
    "Hoc dicto ipse me paulum mirari facio, sed verum est."

# game/a1s7.rpy:756
translate latin a1s7_58c93d68:

    # "Amicus glances at me in surprise."
    "Amicus me miratus breviter intuetur."

# game/a1s7.rpy:757
translate latin a1s7_af121244:

    # a "\"Really?\""
    a "\"Revera?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:758
translate latin a1s7_585bfd15:

    # m "\"Yeah, if it wasn't a risk to your empire.\""
    m "\"Ita, si periculum imperio tuo non esset.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:759
translate latin a1s7_73e280ed:

    # a "\"Of course. I mean to speak to the parents as soon as I'm able. I'm sure...I'm certain we can figure something out.\""
    a "\"Sane. Cum Parentibus loqui intendo simul ac potero. Confido...certus sum nos aliquid excogitare posse.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:760
translate latin a1s7_f5de1c00:

    # "The look on Amicus's face right now, so sad, but a little hopeful, reminds me of something that I've been wanting to do for the past week."
    "Vultus Amici nunc, tam tristis sed paulum spe plenus, me rei admonet quam per proximam hebdomadem facere cupiveram."

# game/a1s7.rpy:761
translate latin a1s7_8917ad0b:

    # m "\"And Amicus?\""
    m "\"Et, Amice?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:762
translate latin a1s7_6b187cc2:

    # a "\"Yeah?\""
    a "\"Quid?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:763
translate latin a1s7_a97f755f:

    # "I glance around quickly, making sure that the nearby patrons aren't listening."
    "Celeriter circumspicio, ut certus sim convivas propinquos non audire."

# game/a1s7.rpy:764
translate latin a1s7_8e14de26:

    # m "\"Do you want to date me?\""
    m "\"Visne me amoris causa frequentare?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:765
translate latin a1s7_92cc0aff:

    # "The statement, so ridiculous, so silly in this situation, comes out all quiet and weak, but I don't know how else to ask it."
    "Hoc dictum, tam ridiculum, tam stultum in hac re, prorsus quietum et debile exit, sed nescio quomodo aliter rogem."

# game/a1s7.rpy:766
translate latin a1s7_fe9e63fe:

    # "That word is so complicated between us now with how I tried to explain it to Amicus."
    "Illud verbum iam tam implicatum inter nos est, propter modum quo illud Amico explicare conatus sum."

# game/a1s7.rpy:767
translate latin a1s7_d661ceb0:

    # "It's something that I don't think I've ever said to anyone before, and just like Amicus, I find myself looking down immediately."
    "Aliquid est quod puto me numquam antea cuiquam dixisse, et sicut Amicus statim oculos demittere me invenio."

# game/a1s7.rpy:768
translate latin a1s7_c69e2e66:

    # "It's quiet for a moment, and the restaurant suddenly lights up with a golden hue as the sunset hits the windows just right."
    "Paulisper silentium est, et caupona subito aureo colore illuminatur, cum lux solis occidentis fenestras recte tangit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:769
translate latin a1s7_af16761a:

    # "I hear a long exhalation and realize that the wolf had been holding his breath."
    "Longam exhalationem audio et intellego lupum spiritum tenuisse."

# game/a1s7.rpy:770
translate latin a1s7_01564cf0:

    # "I look up then, and see Amicus smiling at me."
    "Tum suspicio et Amicum mihi ridentem video."

# game/a1s7.rpy:772
translate latin a1s7_be145690:

    # "There's a mixture of happiness and relief on his face, maybe even a little amusement."
    "Laetitia et levamen in vultu eius miscentur, fortasse etiam aliquid ioci."

# game/a1s7.rpy:773
translate latin a1s7_7c2854bd:

    # "I guess we've been dancing around it for so long, we both knew by now that it's what we wanted, what we've been building up to."
    "Credo nos rem tamdiu circumiisse ut ambo iam sciremus hoc esse quod volebamus, ad quod procedebamus."

# game/a1s7.rpy:774
translate latin a1s7_fd3034d3:

    # a "\"Of course, [mc]. I'm honored that you'd have me.\""
    a "\"Sane, [mc]. Honori mihi est quod me accipias.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:775
translate latin a1s7_257db23a:

    # "I even see his eyes glistening a bit, and I want to get up right there and then and join him on his bed, but public setting holds me back."
    "Oculos eius etiam paulum lucere video, et ibi statim surgere et cum eo in lecto eius coniungi volo, sed locus publicus me retinet."

# game/a1s7.rpy:776
translate latin a1s7_cb798db8:

    # "I imagine Amicus is feeling the same way, and I wonder if maybe asking here in public wasn't the best place for it."
    "Credo Amicum idem sentire, et miror an fortasse hic in publico rogare non optimus locus fuerit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:777
translate latin a1s7_fcb5d47a:

    # "But it was done, and I feel myself grinning despite myself."
    "Sed factum est, et me ipsum invitus late ridere sentio."

# game/a1s7.rpy:778
translate latin a1s7_6785bb70:

    # "The wolf grins right back."
    "Lupus vicissim late ridet."

# game/a1s7.rpy:779
translate latin a1s7_5291e731:

    # m "\"Like you said, while I'm here we might as well get to know each other better...and if you DO figure something out, I can come back.\""
    m "\"Ut dixisti, dum hic sum, melius nos invicem cognoscere possumus...et si aliquid QUIDEM excogitaveris, huc redire possum.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:780
translate latin a1s7_7429e5e3:

    # "Amicus nods and turns his head in a way that he's able to wipe an eye on his shoulder, probably hoping I wouldn't notice."
    "Amicus annuit et ita caput vertit ut oculum in umero tergere possit, probabiliter sperans me non animadversurum esse."

# game/a1s7.rpy:781
translate latin a1s7_e7c9092d:

    # "He looks so relieved, I realize even after we made up in the mediation room he was probably still feeling unsure of where we stood romantically."
    "Tam relevatus videtur; intellego etiam postquam in cubiculo reconciliationis in gratiam rediimus eum probabiliter adhuc incertum fuisse de amore nostro."

# game/a1s7.rpy:782
translate latin a1s7_0e8da352:

    # m "\"But...there are boundaries, and if I'm dating you, you have to tell me everything...and no sleeping around behind my back.\""
    m "\"Sed...fines sunt, et si te amoris causa frequento, omnia mihi dicere debes...nec clam me cum aliis concumbere.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:783
translate latin a1s7_33707796:

    # a "\"Of course. I've promised to tell you everything, especially everything that concerns you, and I don't ever intend on breaking that promise to you.\""
    a "\"Sane. Promisi me omnia tibi dicturum esse, praesertim omnia quae ad te pertinent, et numquam illud promissum tibi datum frangere intendo.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:784
translate latin a1s7_836f780f:

    # m "\"And sleeping around?\""
    m "\"Et cum aliis concumbere?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:785
translate latin a1s7_361ba3a4:

    # "Amicus's ears flick and he glances over at our neighbors who are DEFINITELY trying to eavesdrop."
    "Aures Amici moventur et vicinos nostros breviter intuetur, qui CERTE colloquium auscultare conantur."

# game/a1s7.rpy:786
translate latin a1s7_429699d0:

    # "He lowers his voice a good deal."
    "Vocem multum submittit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:787
translate latin a1s7_9c3a9188:

    # a "\"Definitely not, not that I have anyone to be with...but we can discuss all of this when we get back to our room...and—\""
    a "\"Minime, non quod aliquem habeam quocum sim...sed haec omnia disputare possumus cum in cubiculum nostrum redierimus...et...\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:788
translate latin a1s7_aa6f3099:

    # "Amicus lowers his voice even more."
    "Amicus vocem etiam magis submittit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:789
translate latin a1s7_910d6a42:

    # a "\"Maybe do a little more as well?\""
    a "\"Fortasse paulum amplius quoque facere?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:790
translate latin a1s7_ef781a30:

    # "His ears flatten as I roll my eyes, but they come back up as I smile."
    "Aures eius inclinantur dum oculos volvo, sed rursus tolluntur cum rideo."

# game/a1s7.rpy:791
translate latin a1s7_910f899d:

    # m "\"Sure.\""
    m "\"Sane.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:792
translate latin a1s7_2cb94619:

    # "Immediately, his tail starts thumping the bed, and the eager look on his face has me shaking my head."
    "Statim cauda eius lectum pulsare incipit, et vultus eius avidus me caput quatere facit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:793
translate latin a1s7_888e6df8:

    # "I can't deny that I'm excited too...actually, I'm feeling kind of nervous now that I just promised him that."
    "Negare non possum me quoque concitatum esse...re vera iam aliquantum sollicitus sum, nunc quod id modo ei promisi."

# game/a1s7.rpy:794
translate latin a1s7_935883df:

    # "How would we even start?"
    "Quomodo omnino incipiamus?"

# game/a1s7.rpy:796
translate latin a1s7_c013a260:

    # "We sit together for a while longer, the conversation moving to more casual topics like how the districts of the city are divided up."
    "Paulo diutius una sedemus, colloquio ad leviores res transeunte, velut quomodo regiones urbis dividantur."

# game/a1s7.rpy:797
translate latin a1s7_24a30d53:

    # "Though as an hour passes, I start to feel hot and a little dizzy, and when I mention this to Amicus, he suggests we head back to the palace."
    "Sed cum hora transit, calere et paulum vertigine affici incipio, et cum id Amico dico, suadet ut ad palatium redeamus."

# game/a1s7.rpy:800
translate latin a1s7_0efeff40:

    # "Vita has completely set by the time we're heading out toward the carriage."
    "Vita omnino occidit cum ad raedam egredimur."

# game/a1s7.rpy:801
translate latin a1s7_192da992:

    # "Of course, several delegates surround us as we start to head off, but Amicus promises he'll only be ten minutes and I head out into the street alone to stand next to the chariot."
    "Sane aliquot legati nos circumdant cum discedere incipimus, sed Amicus promittit se tantum decem minuta moraturum esse, et solus in viam egredior ut iuxta currum stem."

# game/a1s7.rpy:802
translate latin a1s7_1ef15621:

    # "It's a bit nicer out here in the open air compared to the stuffy restaurant."
    "Hic sub aperto caelo paulum iucundius est quam in caupona suffocata."

# game/a1s7.rpy:803
translate latin a1s7_ac34038a:

    # "I can tell now that I'm definitely getting sick, and all of that soreness and exhaustion was just the beginnings of a creeping fever that I can feel breaking out across my skin."
    "Iam certo intellegere possum me aegrotare; omnes illi dolores et lassitudo tantum initia febris irrepentis erant, quam per cutem meam erumpere sentio."

# game/a1s7.rpy:804
translate latin a1s7_bb1f2f8f:

    # "I end up sitting on the carriage step, head bowed as I feel myself starting to sweat."
    "Tandem in gradu raedae sedeo, capite demisso, dum me sudare incipere sentio."

# game/a1s7.rpy:805
translate latin a1s7_55f367f2:

    # "It's not anything I haven't felt before, but there's an odd, prickling sensation underneath it all, like pins and needles just under my skin, leaving me wanting to itch at various places on my body."
    "Haec antea quoque sensi, sed sub omnibus mirus aculeorum sensus est, quasi acus et spinae sub ipsa cute sint, ita ut varios corporis locos scalpere cupiam."

# game/a1s7.rpy:806
translate latin a1s7_8a27a823:

    # "I just wish Amicus would hurry up...the others too, since I'm the only one standing here."
    "Tantum cupio Amicum festinare...ceteros quoque, cum solus hic stem."

# game/a1s7.rpy:807
translate latin a1s7_3f30edc7:

    # "I can't even remember where Neferu and Virginia went...someplace shopping, I think."
    "Ne memini quidem quo Neferu et Virginia ierint...aliquo ad merces emendas, credo."

# game/a1s7.rpy:808
translate latin a1s7_85b5b93a:

    # c "\"Simian...\""
    c "\"Simie...\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:809
translate latin a1s7_3a92eeb5:

    # "Cassius's voice is low and quiet to my left, and I glance over to see him leaning up casually against the chariot."
    "Vox Cassii gravis et submissa a sinistra mea auditur; eo respicio et eum currui quasi neglegenter innixum video."

# game/a1s7.rpy:810
translate latin a1s7_974ed0f6:

    # "I make a half-hearted attempt at bowing at him, sort of just flopping my head in his direction."
    "Remisse ei inclinare conor, tantum caput quasi in eius partem demittens."

# game/a1s7.rpy:811
translate latin a1s7_804e9c07:

    # "The wolf glares before walking toward me."
    "Lupus iratis oculis intuetur, deinde ad me ambulat."

# game/a1s7.rpy:813
translate latin a1s7_1fb3dace:

    # c "\"What game are you playing?\""
    c "\"Quem ludum ludis?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:814
translate latin a1s7_0b89a5aa:

    # "Now is probably the worst time for this to happen."
    "Nunc probabiliter pessimum tempus est ut hoc fiat."

# game/a1s7.rpy:815
translate latin a1s7_f9b90ad1:

    # m "\"Game?\""
    m "\"Ludum?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:816
translate latin a1s7_08f61daa:

    # "I mumble out stupidly, looking toward the restaurant to see if I can see Amicus through the crowd gathered in front."
    "Stulte murmuro, ad cauponam spectans ut videam an Amicum per turbam ante eam congregatam videre possim."

# game/a1s7.rpy:818
translate latin a1s7_2acfeaa1:

    # c "\"Do not act stupid. I know you're capable of understanding.\""
    c "\"Ne stultum te fingas. Scio te intellegere posse.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:819
translate latin a1s7_66fbf875:

    # "I just shake my head, but immediately regret it as I feel all the food that I'd just eaten roil around in my stomach."
    "Tantum caput quatio, sed statim paenitet, cum omnem cibum quem modo edi in ventre meo agitari sentiam."

# game/a1s7.rpy:820
translate latin a1s7_cd0c2d3d:

    # "I'm really sick, way more than I'd realized and I can't believe how hard and fast it's hitting me."
    "Vere aegroto, multo magis quam intellexeram, et credere non possum quam graviter et celeriter me afficiat."

# game/a1s7.rpy:822
translate latin a1s7_e2d23ee4:

    # c "\"Do you remember several weeks back in which you served me during midday meal? Virginia and Neferu were there...\""
    c "\"Meministine ante aliquot hebdomades, cum mihi in prandio ministravisti? Virginia et Neferu aderant...\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:823
translate latin a1s7_130893e3:

    # "I just stick to silence now, worried that moving at all is gonna make me hurl."
    "Nunc tantum taceo, timens ne quilibet motus me vomere faciat."

# game/a1s7.rpy:824
translate latin a1s7_d184ce8c:

    # c "\"Of course you remember. You told the triumvirates about what I intended to do with them, didn't you?\""
    c "\"Sane meministi. Triumviris dixisti quid eis facere intenderem, nonne?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:825
translate latin a1s7_10d9ac7c:

    # "Cassius moves closer, but the feelings coursing through my body leaves me not caring all that much about him right now."
    "Cassius propius accedit, sed sensus per corpus meum currentes faciunt ut non multum nunc eum curem."

# game/a1s7.rpy:826
translate latin a1s7_e60b4e7e:

    # "I need to get to Amicus, I need to tell him that something's wrong."
    "Ad Amicum mihi perveniendum est; ei dicere debeo aliquid mali esse."

# game/a1s7.rpy:827
translate latin a1s7_a3d402f2:

    # "I hug myself, feeling that prickling sensation erupt to the surface, my skin on my arms and chest and legs burning and itching in the most horrible way."
    "Me ipsum amplector, illum aculeorum sensum ad superficiem erumpere sentiens, cute bracchiorum, pectoris et crurum horribilissime ardente et pruriente."

# game/a1s7.rpy:828
translate latin a1s7_5b43040e:

    # "I gasp."
    "Spiritum repente haurio."

# game/a1s7.rpy:830
translate latin a1s7_6f3ce762:

    # c "\"What is that, some sort of Simian language? Listen to me. I want to know what you told them...and how you knew to tell them.\""
    c "\"Quid est, quoddam linguae Simiorum genus? Me audi. Scire volo quid eis dixeris...et unde sciveris id eis dicendum esse.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:831
translate latin a1s7_6667703b:

    # "I feel bumps on my arms...bumps that weren't there just minutes ago."
    "Tuberculos in bracchiis sentio...tuberculos qui modo ante pauca minuta non aderant."

# game/a1s7.rpy:832
translate latin a1s7_6f3c3ec8:

    # "I look down and even though it's hard to see in the darkness, I'm at least able to see that the skin is splotchy and discolored."
    "Deorsum aspicio et, quamquam in tenebris difficile est videre, saltem videre possum cutem maculosam et alio colore esse."

# game/a1s7.rpy:833
translate latin a1s7_2f7f08c5:

    # "Shakily, I touch one of the splotches and watch as a tear of clear liquid oozes out."
    "Tremens unam macularum tango et guttam liquoris perlucidi ex ea manantem specto."

# game/a1s7.rpy:834
translate latin a1s7_5d1a8c04:

    # "What the hell?"
    "Quid malum?"

# game/a1s7.rpy:835
translate latin a1s7_debc946e:

    # "Something grabs the front of my robes and pulls me up."
    "Aliquid partem anteriorem tunicarum mearum capit et me sursum trahit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:837
translate latin a1s7_393b2d25:

    # c "\"Are you listening, pet? I said—\""
    c "\"Audisne, animal domesticum? Dixi...\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:838
translate latin a1s7_6ee895c3:

    # "I was worried about small movements, but that huge lurch pushes my stomach over the edge and I immediately projectile vomit straight into the middle of Cassius's torso."
    "Parvos motus timueram, sed ingens ille impulsus ventrem meum tandem superat, et statim magna vi recta in medium truncum Cassii vomo."

# game/a1s7.rpy:840
translate latin a1s7_b0d92235:

    # "We both stare at the mess on his fur which is starting to drip down heavily onto his garments."
    "Ambo sordes in pilis eius fixis oculis intuemur, quae graviter in vestes eius stillare incipiunt."

# game/a1s7.rpy:842
translate latin a1s7_55ec25cd:

    # c "\"Oh...oh gods....OH GODS!\""
    c "\"O...o dei....O DEI!\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:843
translate latin a1s7_aa27f74e:

    # "The wolf screeches and at the same time, I vomit again, right in the same spot."
    "Lupus stridet et simul rursus vomo, recta in eundem locum."

# game/a1s7.rpy:845
translate latin a1s7_c5a10830:

    # "Cassius immediately stumbles back, screeching as he waves his paws uselessly at the mess...then actually starts to retch himself."
    "Cassius statim retro titubat, stridens dum pedes anteriores frustra ad sordes agitat...deinde etiam ipse nauseare incipit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:846
translate latin a1s7_975e2099:

    # "I'm not able to see if he's actually throwing up too."
    "Videre non possum an ille quoque vere vomat."

# game/a1s7.rpy:847
translate latin a1s7_68af3e6f:

    # "Instead, I crumple to sit on the ground, feeling the world spin around me."
    "Sed in terram collapsus sedeo, mundum circum me verti sentiens."

# game/a1s7.rpy:848
translate latin a1s7_011b3b2c:

    # "Thankfully, the next thing I hear is Amicus's voice."
    "Feliciter proximum quod audio vox Amici est."

# game/a1s7.rpy:849
translate latin a1s7_59094e3d:

    # "It sounds like it's coming from far away, even though I can tell that he's crouching right next to me."
    "E longinquo venire videtur, quamquam intellegere possum eum recta iuxta me subsidentem esse."

# game/a1s7.rpy:851
translate latin a1s7_8912f9da:

    # a "\"What did you DO to him, Cassius!?\""
    a "\"Quid ei FECISTI, Cassi!?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:852
translate latin a1s7_4f5e97ea:

    # c "\"I did nothing! He...he...HUUURGH!\""
    c "\"Nihil feci! Ille...ille...HUUURGH!\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:853
translate latin a1s7_de354bf1:

    # "I hear splattering noises."
    "Sonos liquoris sparsi audio."

# game/a1s7.rpy:855
translate latin a1s7_1550595f:

    # a "\"[mc], what happened? What's wrong?\""
    a "\"[mc], quid accidit? Quid mali est?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:856
translate latin a1s7_981f4d29:

    # "I sway and Amicus let's me lean into him despite my vomit-covered robes."
    "Vacillo et Amicus me sibi inniti sinit, quamquam tunicae meae vomitu tectae sunt."

# game/a1s7.rpy:857
translate latin a1s7_b60b2ac1:

    # m "\"I don't...I don't know...\""
    m "\"Nescio...nescio...\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:858
translate latin a1s7_4ace3235:

    # a "\"Was it the food? Are you—\""
    a "\"Cibusne erat? Esne...\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:859
translate latin a1s7_78ec2be5:

    # "I stick out an arm and I feel the wolf catch it delicately, examining it."
    "Bracchium porrigo et lupum id delicate capientem sentio, dum examinat."

# game/a1s7.rpy:860
translate latin a1s7_90196a65:

    # a "\"Gods...\""
    a "\"Dei...\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:861
translate latin a1s7_6737d4cf:

    # "He mumbles it under his breath."
    "Id submissa voce murmurat."

# game/a1s7.rpy:862
translate latin a1s7_979f2534:

    # v "\"What—what happened? Cassius?\""
    v "\"Quid...quid accidit? Cassi?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:864
translate latin a1s7_15b8f772:

    # "I hear more footsteps and for some reason I feel myself becoming embarrassed that everyone's seeing me like this."
    "Plures passus audio et nescio cur erubescere incipiam quod omnes me ita vident."

# game/a1s7.rpy:865
translate latin a1s7_35abb9f7:

    # c "\"That barbarian...urgh...he vomited on me!\""
    c "\"Ille barbarus...urgh...in me vomuit!\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:866
translate latin a1s7_ef024b88:

    # "It sounds like Cassius is about to cry, and for some reason that's pretty funny to me right now."
    "Ex voce Cassius mox fleturus videtur, et nescio cur id nunc mihi satis ridiculum sit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:867
translate latin a1s7_e226bb14:

    # "I try to laugh, but my throat is so sore..."
    "Ridere conor, sed guttur meum tam dolet..."

# game/a1s7.rpy:868
translate latin a1s7_5a0d4099:

    # a "\"Virginia...he's sick.\""
    a "\"Virginia...aegrotat.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:869
translate latin a1s7_6b04b643:

    # n "\"We need to get him back to the palace. Get in the carriage.\""
    n "\"Ad palatium eum reducere debemus. Raedam intrate.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:870
translate latin a1s7_d63b260e:

    # a "\"It's too slow!\""
    a "\"Nimis lenta est!\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:871
translate latin a1s7_a25bfde8:

    # "I feel the world tilt as I seem to just levitate off the ground...then I realize that Amicus has picked me up."
    "Mundum inclinari sentio, dum quasi e terra tantum tollor...deinde intellego Amicum me sustulisse."

# game/a1s7.rpy:872
translate latin a1s7_e2c43ec6:

    # v "\"The Praetors have much faster vehicles. We could get one from them.\""
    v "\"Praetores vehicula multo celeriora habent. Unum ab eis accipere possumus.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:873
translate latin a1s7_804cd142:

    # a "\"[mc]?\""
    a "\"[mc]?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:875
translate latin a1s7_cfd13320:

    # "I hear his voice but for some reason I can't respond...it's like a dream."
    "Vocem eius audio, sed nescio cur respondere non possim...somnio simile est."

# game/a1s7.rpy:876
translate latin a1s7_7143b8ee:

    # a "\"There's no time, I'm running back.\""
    a "\"Tempus non est; cursu redeo.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:877
translate latin a1s7_aae04b86:

    # v "\"Amicus!\""
    v "\"Amice!\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:881
translate latin a1s7_4e19eda5:

    # "I feel my body bouncing up and down, thrown left and right."
    "Corpus meum sursum deorsumque salire sentio, ad sinistram dextramque iactatum."

# game/a1s7.rpy:882
translate latin a1s7_434b7305:

    # "It's like I'm in some kind of demented thrill ride."
    "Quasi insana quadam vectatione ludicra feror."

# game/a1s7.rpy:883
translate latin a1s7_2ba8d1c4:

    # "I reach out into the darkness to stop it somehow, but all I feel is something furry and warm."
    "In tenebras manum porrigo ut id quoquo modo sistam, sed tantum aliquid pilosum et calidum sentio."

# game/a1s7.rpy:884
translate latin a1s7_65cf341d:

    # "Everything hurts and itches at the same time."
    "Omnia simul dolent et pruriunt."

# game/a1s7.rpy:885
translate latin a1s7_b1720f9d:

    # m "\"What...is this?\""
    m "\"Quid...est hoc?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:886
translate latin a1s7_4da25aa4:

    # a "\"[mc]!? Hey, stay with me! I'm here.\""
    a "\"[mc]!? Heus, mecum mane! Hic sum.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:887
translate latin a1s7_5456df42:

    # "Who?"
    "Quis?"

# game/a1s7.rpy:888
translate latin a1s7_35d05bbb:

    # "I force my eyes to open, even though they burn so much."
    "Oculos aperire me cogo, quamquam tam ardent."

# game/a1s7.rpy:890
translate latin a1s7_15154f97:

    # "I stare up at the gnarled things above me, and I wonder what they are."
    "Res nodosas supra me fixis oculis suspicio et miror quid sint."

# game/a1s7.rpy:891
translate latin a1s7_76e1d955:

    # "All that comes to mind are bony, skinless hands reaching up to the sky."
    "Solum quod in mentem venit sunt manus osseae et sine cute ad caelum porrectae."

# game/a1s7.rpy:892
translate latin a1s7_23aad299:

    # a "\"Can you hear me?\""
    a "\"Me audire potes?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:893
translate latin a1s7_f4ce3538:

    # "There's a breathless, wheezing voice above me as the horrible, bouncing ride continues."
    "Vox anhela et sibilans supra me est, dum horribile iter saliens pergit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:894
translate latin a1s7_c5c006dd:

    # "I just want to sleep."
    "Tantum dormire volo."

# game/a1s7.rpy:895
translate latin a1s7_7a6ef9fe:

    # "There's another sound...an odd droning one and the earthquake finally stops."
    "Alius sonus est...mirus susurrus longus, et terrae motus tandem cessat."

# game/a1s7.rpy:896
translate latin a1s7_21e18989:

    # n "\"Amicus! Get in, you fool!\""
    n "\"Amice! Intra, stulte!\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:897
translate latin a1s7_32640c47:

    # a "\"Neferu...he's having seizures...he has pustules all over his body...\""
    a "\"Neferu...convulsionibus afficitur...pustulas per totum corpus habet...\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:898
translate latin a1s7_7e08b105:

    # "The voice above me sobs and gasps and I want to reach up and put a hand over its mouth so that it's quiet, so that I can sleep."
    "Vox supra me singultit et spiritum haurit, et manum sursum porrigere atque os eius tegere volo, ut taceat, ut dormire possim."

# game/a1s7.rpy:899
translate latin a1s7_f7a6256d:

    # n "\"Calm yourself, Virginia's having a physician flown into the palace. You need to...\""
    n "\"Te seda; Virginia medicum volatu in palatium adduci curat. Debes...\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:901
translate latin a1s7_1f578026:

    # "Everything mercifully goes quiet again."
    "Omnia misericorditer rursus silent."

# game/a1s7.rpy:902
translate latin a1s7_3829186f:

    # "I float through a void of quiet, soft, black clouds that tickle and nip at my skin."
    "Per vacuum feror nubium quietarum, mollium et nigrarum, quae cutem meam titillant et mordicant."

# game/a1s7.rpy:903
translate latin a1s7_b3cea4a6:

    # "It itches, and I want to itch, but something seems to be holding me down..."
    "Prurit et scalpere volo, sed aliquid me deorsum tenere videtur..."

# game/a1s7.rpy:905
translate latin a1s7_fdd6002b:

    # "I open my eyes slowly, staring up at the ceiling."
    "Oculos lente aperio, laquear fixis oculis suspiciens."

# game/a1s7.rpy:906
translate latin a1s7_8f3c80d4:

    # "I'm starting to get really annoyed that I can't just fall asleep."
    "Vere vexari incipio quod tantum obdormire non possum."

# game/a1s7.rpy:907
translate latin a1s7_4ca58256:

    # "I have so much to do tomorrow...We're going on a trip to Naples, I think, to try the authentic Italian pizza."
    "Tam multa cras facienda habeo...Neapolim iter faciemus, credo, ut veram pizzam Italicam gustemus."

# game/a1s7.rpy:908
translate latin a1s7_1fbb1981:

    # "I'm gonna have a terrible time if I don't get at least a little..."
    "Terribile mihi erit nisi saltem paulum..."

# game/a1s7.rpy:909
translate latin a1s7_e44187b8:

    # "I realize that I can't move."
    "Intellego me moveri non posse."

# game/a1s7.rpy:910
translate latin a1s7_329e4d02:

    # "Icy fear grips my chest, and at the same time, I see something large scuttling up the wall."
    "Glacialis metus pectus meum tenet, et simul aliquid magnum per parietem sursum currens video."

# game/a1s7.rpy:911
translate latin a1s7_52afd3d5:

    # "A giant spider skitters upwards, its movement off, like it's a puppet being pulled up by strings."
    "Ingens aranea sursum currit, motu perverso, quasi pupula sit funibus sursum tracta."

# game/a1s7.rpy:912
translate latin a1s7_03d2e549:

    # "It moves across the ceiling, and even though it's the size of a giant crab, I can't...move...at...all.\""
    "Per laquear movetur et, quamquam magnitudine ingentis cancri est, nullo...modo...me...movere possum.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:913
translate latin a1s7_4fb8f05a:

    # "\"{i}Adastran arachnids are disturbingly large...{/i}\""
    "\"{i}Arachnida Adastrae tam magna sunt ut perturbent...{/i}\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:914
translate latin a1s7_6ffc5660:

    # "I grit my teeth as it comes to a stop above my head...then falls straight down onto my face, legs fanned out..."
    "Dentes stringo dum recta supra caput meum consistit...deinde recta in vultum meum cadit, cruribus expansis..."

# game/a1s7.rpy:916
translate latin a1s7_5155565c:

    # m "\"GET OFF!\""
    m "\"DISCEDE!\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:917
translate latin a1s7_0dc07b71:

    # "I shove at it, at the things pressing at my face."
    "Eam impello, illas res quae vultum meum premunt."

# game/a1s7.rpy:918
translate latin a1s7_57a91cb3:

    # "\"I told you to hold him down!\""
    "\"Dixi ut eum deorsum teneres!\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:919
translate latin a1s7_8676e06d:

    # a "\"I'm trying! [mc], listen to me, please! You're safe, we're helping you!\""
    a "\"Conor! [mc], me audi, quaeso! Tutus es, te adiuvamus!\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:920
translate latin a1s7_0aa7747d:

    # "I focus on the monsters above me, their massive white teeth and red, glowing eyes."
    "In monstra supra me intentus sum, in dentes eorum ingentes albos et oculos rubros lucentes."

# game/a1s7.rpy:921
translate latin a1s7_103cb1a0:

    # "Their horrible hands come down to press on me, and I feel the pricking pain all over my skin."
    "Horribiles manus eorum descendunt ut me premant, et dolorem pungentem per totam cutem sentio."

# game/a1s7.rpy:922
translate latin a1s7_f9d2d0b7:

    # "I thrash around, but it's no use, they're too strong..."
    "Me vehementer agito, sed frustra, nimis fortes sunt..."

# game/a1s7.rpy:923
translate latin a1s7_6097de67:

    # unk "\"He's having another seizure...\""
    unk "\"Altera convulsione afficitur...\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:925
translate latin a1s7_713d3713:

    # "I lean against the side of a building on the empty road."
    "Lateri aedificii in via vacua innitor."

# game/a1s7.rpy:927
translate latin a1s7_5dfe2ef1:

    # "The night is peaceful and quiet...mostly quiet, I hear clopping sounds in the distance...galloping sounds."
    "Nox tranquilla et quieta est...plerumque quieta; sonos ungularum in longinquo audio...sonos equi currentis."

# game/a1s7.rpy:928
translate latin a1s7_320ed632:

    # "I frown and lean forward a bit, looking up the dark road."
    "Frontem contraho et paulum me prorsum inclino, per tenebrosam viam prospiciens."

# game/a1s7.rpy:929
translate latin a1s7_bf454294:

    # "I see a horse running toward me, its eyes glow red and spit flies from its mouth."
    "Equum ad me currentem video; oculi eius rubri lucent et saliva ex ore eius volat."

# game/a1s7.rpy:930
translate latin a1s7_3f0454de:

    # "Afraid, I press myself closer to the building, but the horse ignores me."
    "Timens propius ad aedificium me premo, sed equus me neglegit."

# game/a1s7.rpy:931
translate latin a1s7_5221b942:

    # "Instead, as it runs past me, I see that it's dragging something..."
    "Sed, dum me praetercurrit, video eum aliquid trahere..."

# game/a1s7.rpy:932
translate latin a1s7_d8342836:

    # "A wolf's headless body, the arms spread out, the stump leaving a long, red streak across the cobblestones."
    "Corpus lupi sine capite, bracchiis expansis, collo truncato longam rubram lineam per silices relinquente."

# game/a1s7.rpy:933
translate latin a1s7_5fdb72e3:

    # "I open my mouth to scream..."
    "Os aperio ut clamem..."

# game/a1s7.rpy:935
translate latin a1s7_d32c23b7:

    # "\"We have nothing on record for his species.\""
    "\"Nihil in tabulis de genere eius habemus.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:936
translate latin a1s7_123d0e08:

    # a "\"Then profile him.\""
    a "\"Tum eius profilum confice.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:937
translate latin a1s7_1827e007:

    # "\"Is there a reason why we don't?\""
    "\"Estne causa cur non habeamus?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:938
translate latin a1s7_a9a95320:

    # a "\"Just heal him...please. It's just avia pox...\""
    a "\"Tantum sana eum...quaeso. Tantum variola avia est...\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:939
translate latin a1s7_e9f66e61:

    # "\"Well, clearly it has a different effect on his species. His nervous system is already damaged beyond repair. You should consider...\""
    "\"Bene, manifeste alium effectum in genere eius habet. Systema eius nervosum iam ita laesum est ut refici non possit. Cogitare debes...\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:941
translate latin a1s7_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "..."

# game/a1s7.rpy:943
translate latin a1s7_d8a5ea85:

    # unk "\"Things never seem to go as planned, do they?\""
    unk "\"Res numquam ut propositum est procedere videntur, nonne?\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:944
translate latin a1s7_a20cefa7_1:

    # "..."
    "..."

# game/a1s7.rpy:945
translate latin a1s7_6b94349a:

    # unk "\"I am sorry that you had to experience this...I did not foresee it.\""
    unk "\"Doleo te haec pati debuisse...non praevidi.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:947
translate latin a1s7_5c86206b:

    # unk "\"Do not worry...you are still on the correct course.\""
    unk "\"Ne time...adhuc in recta via es.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:948
translate latin a1s7_188bdc48:

    # unk "\"You WILL be able to complete this task.\""
    unk "\"Hoc munus perficere CERTE poteris.\""

# game/a1s7.rpy:949
translate latin a1s7_4b10b0b1:

    # unk "\"I just need a little time...\""
    unk "\"Tantum paulo tempore mihi opus est...\""

